he conspiracy?<br /> 5. Any other details you think your character would include.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 11-27-2016, 07:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-04T13:26:31-07:00","id":998413,"title":"","content":"@Eura <br /> <br /> You have access to the same supernatural cipher Ryo used. Basically, Ryo used a custom Linguistics charm off of Letter within Letter that allows members of an oath to Communicate secretly.<br /> <br /> Hmmm... Maybe I should have mentioned detail before....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-04T13:31:43-07:00","id":998416,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=998413#post998413\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">@Eura<br /> <br /> You have access to the same supernatural cipher Ryo used. Basically, Ryo used a custom Linguistics charm off of Letter within Letter that allows members of an oath to Communicate secretly.<br /> <br /> Hmmm... Maybe I should have mentioned detail before....</div> </div> </div> </div>I will continue to find things you didn't explain accidently. mwuahahaha","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-04T15:01:08-07:00","id":998454,"title":"","content":"I swear I will not be that verbose most of the time. Aisa's just <i>very</i> nervous, equal parts giddy and terrified, and that translates to verbosity and floweriness.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-04T19:14:51-07:00","id":998562,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BlueWinds</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=998454#post998454\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I swear I will not be that verbose most of the time. Aisa's just <i>very</i> nervous, equal parts giddy and terrified, and that translates to verbosity and floweriness.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Dragons, I may sit on the Scarlet throne but I had to sell my soul to an Anathema to do it! &quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-04T21:29:56-07:00","id":998607,"title":"","content":"&quot;Sell my soul? No, you must be thinking of some other sorcerer. I deal with Elementals and with Solars, no fey to be found. Their power's all form and no substance anyway. My soul is not for sale. I offer many other fine things, however. What sort of assistance can I render you today?&quot;<br /> <br /> it's not the anathema part that scares her - it's admitting her intentions aloud. Note how she danced around them even when magically assured she can't be eavesdropped on. If she were a 3e Solar, &quot;At Your Service&quot; would be her go-to charm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-06T10:44:34-08:00","id":999307,"title":"","content":"Carmela, meanwhile, is unrelentingly chatty as a matter of course. (And <i>maybe</i> has something to prove to all these Dynasts and Celestials running around.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto","user":"Guancyto","date":". 11-06-2016, 01:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto","name":"Guancyto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"699"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-06T12:46:52-08:00","id":999377,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Guancyto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=999307#post999307\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Carmela, meanwhile, is unrelentingly chatty as a matter of course. (And <i>maybe</i> has something to prove to all these Dynasts and Celestials running around.)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I can't decide if Ryo should active Sagacious Reading of Intent to see if Carmela is telling the truth about punching/fucking two different Solars or if Ryo should be one of these Solars. Probably the one Camela punched as I doubt she would be attracted to middle aged bureaucrats.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 11-06-2016, 03:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-06T13:04:57-08:00","id":999387,"title":"","content":"Aw shit, people with lie detection charms, my eternal bane!<br /> <br /> I mean, if there weren't any particular need to attach a truth value to the shit she said, she would of course clarify that they were Yurgen Kaneko and Samea, respectively, when they were trying very hard to attract outcastes (such as Risa) to their cause. :P<br /> <br /> As it is, she's <i>probably</i> making at least one of those up. But she wouldn't have punched Ryo (at least not that hard) if he's total crap at defending himself. Or if she had, definitely wouldn't brag about it afterward. There's no glory in knocking a middle-aged bureaucrat's block off, after all!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto","user":"Guancyto","date":". 11-06-2016, 04:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto","name":"Guancyto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"699"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-06T13:17:08-08:00","id":999394,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Guancyto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=999387#post999387\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Aw shit, people with lie detection charms, my eternal bane!<br /> <br /> I mean, if there weren't any particular need to attach a truth value to the shit she said, she would of course clarify that they were Yurgen Kaneko and Samea, respectively, when they were trying very hard to attract outcastes (such as Risa) to their cause. :P<br /> <br /> As it is, she's <i>probably</i> making at least one of those up. But she wouldn't have punched Ryo (at least not that hard) if he's total crap at defending himself. Or if she had, definitely wouldn't brag about it afterward. There's no glory in knocking a middle-aged bureaucrat's block off, after all!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I figured it was totally bullshit, but Ryo, being the paranoid type, would check. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Also, I have this funny scene in my head of your character arguing with some poor fool and Ryo just happened to be in the wrong place in the wrong time. The poor fool dodged and you unintentionally socked Ryo in the face. Ryo tries to make light of his injury and runs off. You track him down to apologize and discover he really isn't hurt, being an Exalt and all. And thus begins your correspondence.<br /> <br /> Either way, Ryo wouldn't tell on your lies. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-06T14:00:17-08:00","id":999414,"title":"","content":"Not sure if I should Pm this or post it here, but Scroll of the monk has been infamously ignored in scroll of errata. My question is &quot;can we make Flurry of august leaves concentration (pg. 88 scroll of monk) combo-OK instead of combo-basic&quot;? It really seems to go against the mentality of the style. All of my prep charms don't synergize with my finisher, why?<br /> <br /> <b>Crunch</b>: I need to spend an action activating my form for 5 motes, have 3 props that preferably can leave my person, half my props are probably not naturally a weapon so I need to use Lethal Paper fan attack to make them weapons. Lethal paper fan is supplemental and therefore can't combo with my august leaves because that charm is combo-basic. Vindictive Concubine is supplemental so it has the same problem and that one just lowers armored soak. Now I will admit August leaves is Simple (dv-2) so you could theoretically use an extra action charm with it if it was combo-OK, but as a dragon-blooded I would have to go deep in a TMA or you know, just have an addendum saying you can't/ get rid of the DV penalty and make it extra-action. If I really wanted a doom flurry there's loads of different and better ways I could do that. Solar archery does this trick better with Rain of feathered death anyway.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-06T14:06:00-08:00","id":999418,"title":"","content":"I'm okay with changing the keyword.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-06T14:25:12-08:00","id":999431,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=999418#post999418\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm okay with changing the keyword.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hurray, not sure how crunch oriented the game will be. It's possible charm timing won't even come up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-06T14:38:51-08:00"