e-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I figured it was totally bullshit, but Ryo, being the paranoid type, would check. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Also, I have this funny scene in my head of your character arguing with some poor fool and Ryo just happened to be in the wrong place in the wrong time. The poor fool dodged and you unintentionally socked Ryo in the face. Ryo tries to make light of his injury and runs off. You track him down to apologize and discover he really isn't hurt, being an Exalt and all. And thus begins your correspondence.<br /> <br /> Either way, Ryo wouldn't tell on your lies. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>See, the flipside of not having people with lie detection charms is that everyone figures it's bullshit right up until it turns out to be true. &gt;:P<br /> <br /> That would make a fine meeting, though!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto","name":"Guancyto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"699"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-06T17:45:44-08:00","id":999502,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Guancyto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=999481#post999481\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">See, the flipside of not having people with lie detection charms is that everyone figures it's bullshit right up until it turns out to be true. &gt;:P<br /> <br /> That would make a fine meeting, though!</div> </div> </div> </div>Ryo is only using it because you mentioned other Solars. Solars are rare, so he is interested in any news of them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-06T18:52:50-08:00","id":999522,"title":"","content":"I should note that Aisa is perfectly serious about other members of the conspiracy needing to be able to defend against / be watching for dematerialized threats. If you don't say anything about it (that you can deal with spirits just fine) in your week one letters, there <i>will </i>be an elemental watching over your shoulder as soon as a Cloud Person or Huraka can fly to your side. You'll probably never know they're there unless there's trouble.<br /> <br /> Except Whispering Twilight, because fellow sorcerer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-06T23:27:59-08:00","id":999593,"title":"","content":"Quelaana would notice during a performance and vainly think it was a spirit thinking they don't need to pay for a ticket. I doubt Aisa would know Dreaming Pearl is a celestial style and therefore fail to presume I'd know Moment of Daana'd's/Pasiap's Humility. I'd then proceed to fine him 5 Koku unless he said he was with Aisa.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-07T05:15:00-08:00","id":999671,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BlueWinds</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=999522#post999522\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I should note that Aisa is perfectly serious about other members of the conspiracy needing to be able to defend against / be watching for dematerialized threats. If you don't say anything about it (that you can deal with spirits just fine) in your week one letters, there <i>will </i>be an elemental watching over your shoulder as soon as a Cloud Person or Huraka can fly to your side. You'll probably never know they're there unless there's trouble.<br /> <br /> Except Whispering Twilight, because fellow sorcerer.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah, whispering twilight cant personally check for dematerialized beings, but usually dont do anything serious without a demon or two in presence that can. <br /> <br /> Love the fact that your bringing this up. Its a sneaky vector that is important to guard...<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat","name":"Volivat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-09T13:07:35-08:00","id":1000949,"title":"","content":"I posted Titus' letter, which I forgot about until just now. On Friday evening, I will post Ryo's next letter and reward XP to those who wrote introduction letters. After I post Ryo's letter, you can start sending me your plans for the Resplendent Air Letter.<br /> <br /> If you can't figure it out from the letter, I am deviating from the Canon Timeline in one major way. OOC Knowledge Spoilers:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Chejop Kejak is dead.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 11-09-2016, 04:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-09T13:39:05-08:00","id":1000960,"title":"","content":"So. Excited.<br /> <br /> Also, it Titus thinks Aisa's going to ignore the fact that he didn't mention his exalt type, unlike every other person who's sent her letter so far, he's sorely mistaken. And if he can't tell her about the old man... well... that just means it's time for some investigative work.<br /> <br /> &quot;Ooh, he's being mysterious. I'd better poke it with a stick.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-09T13:41:33-08:00","id":1000962,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BlueWinds</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1000960#post1000960\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So. Excited.<br /> <br /> Also, it Titus thinks Aisa's going to ignore the fact that he didn't mention his exalt type, unlike every other person who's sent her letter so far, he's sorely mistaken. And if he can't tell her about the old man... well... that just means it's time for some investigative work.<br /> <br /> &quot;Ooh, he's being mysterious. I'd better poke it with a stick.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>He's an NPC. Poke away!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-09T15:05:31-08:00","id":1001011,"title":"","content":"Remember, until proven otherwise everyone is a sidereal, especially if you're playing a Sidereal. I'm fully expecting for npc Sidereals to assume I'm serenity until proven otherwise.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-09T15:17:39-08:00","id":1001022,"title":"","content":"It's not like the Sidereals announce to the rest the Resplendent Destinies they own.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T11:45:24-08:00","id":1001861,"title":"","content":"That moment when your Solar almost botches his integrity roll. Good thing I spent willpower.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=3CLXK9FN\" target=\"_blank\">24(6d10) = 24</a><br /> <br /> Yeah... I need to buy the Integrity Excellency.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T12:24:55-08:00","id":1001875,"title":"","content":"Clarification on Week One and Dice Rolling<br /> <br /> <u>Week one</u><ol class=\"decimal\"><li>The Storyteller will post a Nellens Ryo letter to give an update on the Imperial Court. ST may PM a player a potential plot line.</li> <li>The Players will private message the Storyteller or post in the OOC thread what they play to do in their location. Players suggested complications if they wish.</li> <li>The Storyteller will respond with complications to the players\u2019 plans and the difficulty rating for the complications. For now, we will use the difficulty table on Ex2 Core page 120 <ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Standard</li> <li>Difficult</li> <li>Challenging</li> <li>Near Impossible</li> <li>+ Legendary</li> </ol></li> <li>The Player will respond back with their solution to the complications. Each complication will require one skill roll. In addition, the player will roll any required charm rolls. Use <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/\" target=\"_blank\">this dice roller</a>.</li> <li>Storyteller approves player's dice rolls and solutions.</li> </ol>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T12:42:36-08:00","id":1001882,"title":"","content":"<u><b>Example Letter Situation</b></u><br /> <br /> <b>Situation:</b> A requisition for 50 slaves from V'neef's supply officer comes across Ryo's desk. Ryo notices the requisition does not include upkeep for the slaves. And he is curious as to what V'neef wants the slaves for. He flags the requisition and sends it back to V'neef's supply office. Ryo expect the man to set up a meeting, giving Ryo a chance to pick his brain.<br /> <br /> <b>Complication:</b> V'neef's supply officer doesn't show up. V'neef herself does.<br /> <br /> <b>Solution:</b> Ryo is in damage control mode. He hasn't survived the past year in the Imperial City taking stupid risks. And this risk just got stupid. He plans on enduring whatever bullshit V'neef throws at him, signing the paper, and slow down the slave delivery. This will give him time to find another solution for the problem.<br /> <br /> <b>Dice Roll: </b> Integrity - Difficulty 3. Remember to check the &quot;Show Dice Detail&quot; box on the dice roller. <a href=\"https://acidspiders.files.wordpress.com/2016/11/scarletskybaddice.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">Otherwise it will combine all your dice into a total.</a><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <img src=\"https://acidspiders.files.wordpress.com/2016/11/scarletskysampleroll.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Dice Roll Result:</b> <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=3CLXK9FN\" target=\"_blank\">1 Success.</a><br /> <br /> Ryo fails his roll and loses his temper with the Dragonblooded. He doesn't botch (thanks to willpower), so he doesn't arouse V'neef's suspicions.<br /> <br /> <b>Charm Dice Roll</b>: Indolent Official Charm - Difficulty 4. (I couldn't find a Character sheet for V'neef, so I just took the Intelligence and Bureaucracy from the Roseblack for now.)<br /> <br /> <b>Charm Dice Roll Result:</b> <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=62XYBNL4\" target=\"_blank\">12 Successes </a> (Ryo uses 14 motes of personal essence for this charm/excellency)<br /> <br /> After his failure in his office, Ryo doesn't fuck around. He uses the 2nd Excellency to boost his roll. (I hope I did this right. I could not remember if non-excellency charm success limits the successes added to the 2nd Excellency)<br /> <br /> Ryo managed to slow V'neef down, but the slaves are still an problem to be solved. (I probably could have gone on longer, but my letter was already two pages long. We will save you next month, poor slaves!)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 11-11-2016, 04:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T13:01:38-08:00","id":1001891,"title":"","content":"<u><b>Experience for RY 767 Ascending Air</b></u><br /> <br /> <b>Nellens Ryo - 8 points</b><br /> Who are you? - 1 point<br /> Where are you? - 1 point<br /> What can you bring to the conspiracy? - 1 point<br /> Why did you join the conspiracy? - 1 point<br /> Beginning game bonus - 4 points<br /> <br /> <b>Ferem Quelaana - 8 Points</b><br /> Who are you? - 1 point<br /> Where are you? - 1 point<br /> What can you bring to the conspiracy? - 1 point<br /> Why did you join the conspiracy? - 1 point<br /> Beginning game bonus - 4 points<br /> <br /> <b>Mnemon Aisa - 8 points</b><br /> Who are you? - 1 point<br /> Where are you? - 1 point<br /> What can you bring to the conspiracy? - 1 point<br /> Why did you join the conspiracy? - 1 point<br /> Beginning game bonus - 4 points<br /> <br /> <b>Whispering Twilight - 8 points</b><br /> Who are you? - 1 point<br /> Where are you? - 1 point<br /> What can you bring to the conspiracy? - 1 point<br /> Why did you join the conspiracy? - 1 point<br /> Beginning game bonus - 4 points<br /> <br /> <b>Carmela Contarini - 8 points</b><br /> Who are you? - 1 point<br /> Where are you? - 1 point<br /> What can you bring to the conspiracy? - 1 point<br /> Why did you join the conspiracy? - 1 point<br /> Beginning game bonus - 4 points<br /> <br /> My old ST gave extra xp for the first game. I will continue that trend for the first letter. I'll reward extra xp when we complete the first group of letters.<br /> <br /> Remember, we are using the Solar XP table on page 274 for all characters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 11-11-2016, 04:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T14:06:13-08:00","id":1001929,"title":"","content":"I posted Ryo's letter. His letters are still awkward to write. Hero has much more informal tone and are written in second person instead of first.<br /> <br /> When I first started, I had trouble writing the first letter. Then I realized I needed you guys to write letters about your characters and their goals. After that, my half page letter grew to two pages. I didn't even mention Aisa's offer of immaterial protection, Ryo's wife, or the cat!<br /> <br /> I included some possible story lines to build off at the end of the letters. If you have better ideas, you can ignore them. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 11-11-2016, 05:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T16:04:19-08:00","id":1001966,"title":"","content":"Ok, PM away! I think in general I'll post stuff here rather than in PM, but I wanted to see if this is what you were expecting from us before putting it out in the harsh light of day. *^^*","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T17:31:52-08:00","id":1002001,"title":"","content":"You guys working on any backgrounds this month?<br /> <br /> (I forgot about Roy's backgrounds myself)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 11-11-2016, 08:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T18:01:18-08:00","id":1002017,"title":"","content":"I was wanting Reputation 2 personally. and I suppose Roseblack as an ally.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T18:10:55-08:00","id":1002023,"title":"","content":"Roseblack is a five point ally. It will take you five letters actively working on your ally.<br /> <br /> Hmmm.. I'll have to check Aisa's character sheet. Did you take mnemon as an ally, BlueWinds.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 11-11-2016, 09:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T18:50:50-08:00","id":1002037,"title":"","content":"Stupid important npc's making me work so they can love me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-12T08:29:01-08:00","id":1002226,"title":"","content":"I took Mnemon as &quot;Family&quot; but not as ally.<br /> <br /> I'm working on upgrading my Contacts 1 into Contacts 2. I'll mention that explicitly in my PM next time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-12T08:50:12-08:00","id":1002236,"title":"","content":"No worries. <br /> <br /> I also still owe you a description of V'neef's operation at the Imperial Manse. I will get that to you later this week.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-12T09:39:29-08:00","id":1002251,"title":"","content":"Looking through the situation more (and actually writing my response), I'm actually working for Reputation 2 instead. Contacts is the fallback if N'neef doesn't bite (or Iphen remains obstinate).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-12T12:29:00-08:00","id":1002310,"title":"","content":"A question! The recruitment thread lists the one trying to get into the Imperial Manse as V'Neef Bijar, first name Bijar and a member of House V'Neef.<br /> <br /> The letter mentions the one trying to get into the Imperial Manse is V'Neef with no first name which indicates <i>the</i> V'Neef, first of her name, daughter of the Empress, imperial princess and head of House V'Neef.<br /> <br /> I just want to determine whether that was or wasn't a mistake before I contemplate a course of action!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto","user":"Guancyto","date":". 11-12-2016, 04:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto","name":"Guancyto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"699"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-12T13:33:57-08:00","id":1002333,"title":"","content":"Oh, man. I got my V'Neefs confused. It is one of her daughters that is trying to unlock the manse. I'll update Ryo's letter after dinner. Basically, the same thing happens, just with Bijar.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-12T14:57:13-08:00","id":1002372,"title":"","content":"I'm glad Guan asked because I thought it was THE V'neef too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-12T21:02:59-08:00","id":1002457,"title":"","content":"Oh dear, so did I. Which probably explains why I was being sneaky and trying to attract her attention - I thought Aisa was dealing with the head of a Great House, which seemed like a grand opportunity!<br /> <br /> Do you want to write it off as &quot;Ryu was flustered by the angry dynast and didn't explain what he meant properly,&quot; and we can all carry on with some IC confusion, or retcon the information given (and I'll tweak that particular part of Aisa's action for this week a little), or something else?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-12T21:59:41-08:00","id":1002464,"title":"","content":"We will just roll with it in character. Ryo spends his time avoiding most high status Dragonblooded, thus has never seen either V'cleef before this incident. Titus will never let Ryo live this confusion down. Tweak your character's actions as you see fit, BlueWinds<br /> <br /> It wouldn't be a wonderandawe game without some sort of major lore screw up. My quest character still needs to invite Disguise of a New Face and move Wallport to the opposite coast. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 11-13-2016, 01:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-14T09:57:22-08:00","id":1002935,"title":"","content":"Just to make sure I have all this down:<br /> <br /> Eura Backgrounds for Resplendent Air<br /> Influence 2 - Cherak? North? (1/2 letters)<br /> Ally 5 - Roseblack (1/5 letters)<br /> <br /> BlueWinds Backgrounds for Resplendent Air<br /> Reputation 2 - Heptagram (1/1 letters)<br /> Contacts 2 - Heptagram Students (1/2 letters)<br /> <br /> Influence seems to be Reputation, per Ex2 Core page 112.<br /> <br /> BlueWinds seems to be ready for the next letter. Eura is close. So far everyone has sent me around three actions per month, which includes background actions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 11-15-2016, 08:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-14T11:01:04-08:00","id":1002964,"title":"","content":"I never realized how close the two backgrounds were. Reputation has a mechanical bonus but influence is far stronger plot wise. Influence is better so I agree with going for that instead.influence 2 is home city-state or satrapy so Cherak, Cathak is a blessed isle family :P.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-14T12:41:19-08:00","id":1003014,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1002964#post1002964\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I never realized how close the two backgrounds were. Reputation has a mechanical bonus but influence is far stronger plot wise. Influence is better so I agree with going for that instead.influence 2 is home city-state or satrapy so Cherak, Cathak is a blessed isle family :P.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> There needs to be more letters in the alphabet so every name can have it's own letter. :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-14T17:19:07-08:00","id":1003151,"title":"","content":"Where does Reputation have a mechanical effect?<br /> <br /> I won't deny that Influence is a more powerful background, and maybe Reputation didn't need to exist, but reputation is both what I already have a dot of and what I was working for a second one towards - getting people to recognize &quot;hey, here's a name we recognize,&quot; rather than &quot;hey, here's a person I owe favors to.&quot;<br /> <br /> Basically, first acquire a Reputation, then leverage that into Influence later.<br /> <br /> Also, wonderandawe, you might want to clarify the OP in this thread:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> You may work on at most two <b>different</b> backgrounds in one letter. For example, you can\u2019t double up on increasing your resources in one letter. Two different backgrounds in the same category (Contacts: Legion, Contacts: House Cathak) can be worked towards in the same letter. </div> </div> </div>That says &quot;may... at most&quot;, then says you can't double up. Should it instead be &quot;must... at least&quot;?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-14T17:36:56-08:00","id":1003160,"title":"","content":"You can't work on more than two backgrounds in one letter. You don't have to work on any backgrounds if you choose. <br /> <br /> You can't double up on backgrounds. For example, you can't get two points towards Ally Roseblack in one month. But you can work towards one point in Ally Roseblack and another point in Ally Bob the Fence. <br /> <br /> I need to find Reputation in the Ex2 books. I didn't see it in the core.<br /> <br /> (Edit: Google says it is in the Dragonblooded book. I'll look it over when I get home.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 11-14-2016, 08:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-14T17:43:46-08:00","id":1003161,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1003160#post1003160\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You can't work on more than two backgrounds in one letter. You don't have to work on any backgrounds if you choose.<br /> <br /> You can't double up on backgrounds. For example, you can't get two points towards Ally Roseblack in one month. But you can work towards one point in Ally Roseblack and another point in Ally Bob the Fence.<br /> <br /> I need to find Reputation in the Ex2 books. I didn't see it in the core.<br /> <br /> (Edit: Google says it is in the Dragonblooded book. I'll look it over when I get home.)</div> </div> </div> </div>I guess what I'm trying to get at is this: you can only get one dot of backgrounds in a letter. So the sentence about &quot;doubling up&quot; is completely redundant, isn't it?<br /> <br /> Oh, sorry, I guess I never did mention where the background was! Yeah, MoEP: DB, page 110.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-14T18:07:41-08:00","id":1003175,"title":"","content":"This is an instance I like to call &quot;browning the beef&quot; where everyone assumes somebody knows something assumed to be common knowledge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-14T20:29:28-08:00","id":1003218,"title":"","content":"It is redundant. I'm probably bring my corporatese into the game. I write redundant emails all the time, just to verify a business client understands the technical explanation I am giving. And to make sure they don't use something that isn't completely clear against me later. &quot;You said I could have two backgrounds, so why can't I use both of them in resources.&quot; &quot;Those are background points, not backgrounds.&quot; &quot;I don't see the different. I still want my two resource points. &quot;<br /> <br /> I didn't realize I was doing it. I doubt you guys are going to try to argue technicalities like my clients, so I'll try to be less corporate. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 11-14-2016, 11:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-15T17:40:41-08:00","id":1003704,"title":"","content":"I wrote 90% of my letter last night, ready to post today once I received an answer... and this morning I can't find it. I could swear I saved it somewhere on my computer, but no go.<br /> <br /> Arg.<br /> <br /> Will write it up again soon, tomorrow if not tonight. Right now I'm going to eat dinner and mope about it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-15T17:58:43-08:00","id":1003714,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BlueWinds</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1003704#post1003704\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wrote 90% of my letter last night, ready to post today once I received an answer... and this morning I can't find it. I could swear I saved it somewhere on my computer, but no go.<br /> <br /> Arg.<br /> <br /> Will write it up again soon, tomorrow if not tonight. Right now I'm going to eat dinner and mope about it.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Bah. That has happened to me before. Nothing worse than rewriting what you have already written from scratch.<br /> <br /> We are posting letters starting on Friday. I just need to hear from <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2144_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2144\" data-vbnamecard=\"2144\">Guancyto</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4567\" data-vbnamecard=\"4567\">Volivat</a> with their Resplendent Air actions.<br /> <br /> You can up Reputation, BlueWinds. I'll change the background in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1002935#post1002935\">my previous post</a>. I believe the last thing you are waiting for is a description of the operation around the Imperial Manse. Is that correct?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-16T04:13:02-08:00","id":1003856,"title":"","content":"Hi,<br /> <br /> Whispering Twilight is up to these things:<br /> <br /> 1. Bumping his ally from 3 to 4, making him a dragon lord in the legion he serves in.<br /> <br /> 2. Gaining dot 1 contacts in the Great House Ledaal<br /> <br /> (When is the next new moon?) Planning on summoning a spy themed 2nd circle demon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat","name":"Volivat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-16T06:00:56-08:00","id":1003883,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Volivat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1003856#post1003856\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi,<br /> <br /> Whispering Twilight is up to these things:<br /> <br /> 1. Bumping his ally from 3 to 4, making him a dragon lord in the legion he serves in.<br /> <br /> 2. Gaining dot 1 contacts in the Great House Ledaal</div> </div> </div> </div>How do you plan on getting your friend promoted? Arjuf doesn't see too much combat, so I assume your character and his friend are going to be playing legion politics. Is your friend going to solve a thorny problem for his legion, thus impressing the general? Or are you planning on backstabbing his competition for the promotion? Or both?<br /> <br /> Create a contact for yourself in House Ledaal. Come up with a plausible way your character could meet the contact. Maybe you impressed him with your lore knowledge? Or just struck up a good conversation? <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Volivat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1003856#post1003856\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> (When is the next new moon?) Planning on summoning a spy themed 2nd circle demon.</div> </div> </div> </div>*checks <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/835500-3ed-creation-s-calendar\">calendar</a>*<br /> <br /> New Moon is 12th, 13th, and 14th of this month (and every month). Do you have a particular 2nd circle demon in mind or are you created a custom one?<br /> <br /> Let me know the answers to these questions and I will get back with you with the dice rolls. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-16T08:00:08-08:00","id":1003939,"title":"","content":"1.<br /> <br /> One of the dragon lords in the legion is an outcaste and wont be missed that much by the powers in the realm. So Whispering Twilight's ally will get him alone for a chat while his manservant is present. Then when the manservant (Whispering Twilight) serves the outcaste dragon lord his glass of refreshment he makes sure to accidentally touch the outcaste and then using hyponotic tongue technique to compel him to confess all his damning secrets, in the eyes of the legion, to his ally. The ally will utilize that info to usurp that dragon lords spot.<br /> <br /> 2.<br /> <br /> My ally is a Ledaal himself so I ask him for some connected people in the Ledaal household that visits Arjuf now and then. Wearing a disguise as an old man (spell disguise) I strike up a conversation with one of them discussing lore and occult matters. The contact in particular is a sorcerer so it is likely he will find the topics interesting.<br /> <br /> 3.<br /> <br /> I just checked the demons available, seems like id need to design one. Any thoughts on how we should go about doing that? Ill most likely copy some other demons stat block and just change things towards spying.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat","name":"Volivat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-16T08:22:20-08:00","id":1003952,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Volivat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1003939#post1003939\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1.<br /> <br /> One of the dragon lords in the legion is an outcaste and wont be missed that much by the powers in the realm. So Whispering Twilight's ally will get him alone for a chat while his manservant is present. Then when the manservant (Whispering Twilight) serves the outcaste dragon lord his glass of refreshment he makes sure to accidentally touch the outcaste and then using hyponotic tongue technique to compel him to confess all his damning secrets, in the eyes of the legion, to his ally. The ally will utilize that info to usurp that dragon lords spot.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's so immoral and back stabby. I like it.<br /> <br /> Roll your Hypnotic Tongue Technique Roll (Manipulation + Larceny) against a Mental DV of 5 (I used Tepet Lisara (Ex2 Core page 326) as a template for this NPC).<br /> <br /> Have your Dragonblooded Ally roll Socialize (Difficulty 2) to take advantage of the situation your characters created.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Volivat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1003939#post1003939\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2.<br /> <br /> My ally is a Ledaal himself so I ask him for some connected people in the Ledaal household that visits Arjuf now and then. Wearing a disguise as an old man (spell disguise) I strike up a conversation with one of them discussing lore and occult matters. The contact in particular is a sorcerer so it is likely he will find the topics interesting.</div> </div> </div> </div>Roll Disguise of a New Face to create your persona.<br /> <br /> Roll Lore or Occult (Difficulty 2) to Impress your new friend.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Volivat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1003939#post1003939\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">3.<br /> <br /> I just checked the demons available, seems like id need to design one. Any thoughts on how we should go about doing that? Ill most likely copy some other demons stat block and just change things towards spying.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, Just tweak a stat block to spying type. The most important part of creating a new demon would be the demon's background. What makes this demon a second circle besides higher stats? What is their exotic interest in Creation? Is this demon going to be pissed at you for dragging it away from its domain in Malfeas or thankful you are giving it an outlet for all of its voyeur instincts?<br /> <br /> Roll either Occult or Lore (Difficulty 3) to make sure you are summoning the right demon. I doubt you are going to find a second circle demon's true name in the White Treatise.<br /> <br /> Roll your Demon Summoning dice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T07:28:27-08:00","id":1004401,"title":"","content":"I created a <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1ZCFTahn26VdjhdpHZ69kyAkG2yRiEYAt67-5GDmSP10\" target=\"_blank\">spreadsheet</a> to track Experience and Backgrounds. Please let me know if I am missing any XP purchases.<br /> <br /> I haven't added the backgrounds from the upcoming letter yet, as it hasn't been written. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T07:50:49-08:00","id":1004421,"title":"","content":"I'm toying with the idea of tracking all the moving parts of the game on the <a href=\"https://scarletskyconspiracy.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Obsidian Portal</a>. We will still play and discuss here, but I want to create a wiki to keep all of our ducks in a row. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T08:22:57-08:00","id":1004437,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1004421#post1004421\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm toying with the idea of tracking all the moving parts of the game on the <a href=\"https://scarletskyconspiracy.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Obsidian Portal</a>. We will still play and discuss here, but I want to create a wiki to keep all of our ducks in a row. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I think that's an excellent idea.<br /> <br /> Also, letter is now written for the second time, just going to let it sit a few hours and proofread again before posting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T08:26:30-08:00","id":1004438,"title":"","content":"Send me your obsidian portal account name and I will add you to the game. I'll see if I can play with the campaign permissions so you guys can post an track your own NPCs on the site.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T09:26:48-08:00","id":1004469,"title":"","content":"Thanks to <a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=legion+of+the+five+rings+sword&amp;tbm=isch&amp;tbs=rimg:CQ-8ja5OtRNyIjjpJLwSFtgnRYnH_1d_1voyerKMWIf3DQ0KPd5sqd7u6_1gZ0EdVljd6U8znCllbBbpgBxDQs8DA6OOioSCekkvBIW2CdFERZ_1cbkiRlueKhIJicf93--jJ6sRZCkuAhyrBqgqEgkoxYh_1cNDQoxHRXvc2CrY8MyoSCd3myp3u7r-BEZCRNYcpEB7oKhIJnQR1WWN3pTwRjsTZQNDcLhAqEgnOcKWVsFumABHmidkHkUov6yoSCXENCzwMDo46EbvITQ9usWDQ&amp;tbo=u#safe=active&amp;tbm=isch&amp;q=legend+of+the+five+rings\" target=\"_blank\">Legend of the Five Rings</a>, I found character pictures for both <a href=\"https://scarletskyconspiracy.obsidianportal.com/characters/nellens-ryo\" target=\"_blank\">Ryo</a> and <a href=\"https://scarletskyconspiracy.obsidianportal.com/characters/cathak-titus\" target=\"_blank\">Titus</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T10:52:45-08:00","id":1004529,"title":"","content":"A 2nd Circle demon I wrote up once that might work as a spy:<br /> <br /> <b>Shimmering Will, Seneschal of the Lotus Dream</b><br /> In Malfeas there is a swamp where poppy and great scarlet lotuses bloom. They grow from a muck of honey and grapeskins and float on a sea of wine. Here and there, like logs, sleepers float, clinging to lotus stems that they nibble in their sleep. This swamp is in no one place, it oozed from cracks in the pavement of the demon city, or floats like a sweat current on the demon sea, or wells up like a feted oasis from the silver sands. Its maddening scent can waft from anywhere, or nowhere. It temps the residents of that mad realm to a respite from fear or pain or sorrow. Yet more wicked than the promise itself is that it is true.<br /> <br /> Shimmering Will is a skeletal humanoid with body and bones woven from twisted, thorny, black roots. Though he may chose to cover himself more appealingly in the petals of some beautiful white flower he most often refrains, seeing little need for the ostentation. In an ancient time he was a warrior, an enemy of the the mad dreams of the Wyld. Then and now his merest touch could break any enchantment or illusion. Even now the moly plant that grows where his blood was shed in long ago battles retains much of his potency. It is for this reason that he alone is trusted to oversea the swamp of the lotus dream. It is also why he alone shall never enjoy the respite it offers, forever immune to its affects.<br /> <br /> Sorcerers summon his to fight the Fair Folk on their behalf, a task he accepts without the need for binding. In combat he wields a black spear grown from his own body who's tip glistens with the soporific venom of his land. Those struck grow ever more at ease until they die quietly and in peace. To be denied glory in death is a particular sting to the nobility of Rakshastan. He is also called to manipulate or steal from enemies. He may see and mold the drug-induced dreams of those in his care, anyone who partakes of his lotuses, allowing him to mine dreams for secrets or plant insidious suggestions in the minds of those who unknowingly enter his domain.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Edit: wonderandawe, should I PM you my plans for the next letter or just post them here?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 11-17-2016, 01:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T11:19:58-08:00","id":1004539,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1004529#post1004529\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Edit: wonderandawe, should I PM you my plans for the next letter or just post them here?</div> </div> </div> </div>Whatever you prefer.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T11:42:43-08:00","id":1004557,"title":"","content":"There's an annoying discreprency in the north specific map and the creation world map. There's a fairly large river going from the northern inland sea up through the north a few 100 miles west of Cherak. There's quite a few cities close to the odds and ends of this river. There's a second large river (not as big the first) that's in between White ribs and Sunset Greenfield. Make note if there's anything sail based going on in the north, I'll be using at least one of them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T11:54:02-08:00","id":1004560,"title":"","content":"So... Obsidian Portal has an <a href=\"https://scarletskyconspiracy.obsidianportal.com/maps/84531\" target=\"_blank\">awesome map feature</a>. Much better than my trashy photoshop map.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T14:12:19-08:00","id":1004621,"title":"","content":"The map doesn't work well for me. It's squashed into a square (distorting the aspect ratio), and there aren't any markers or anything on it. Also I can't zoom in. Tried in both Firefox and Chromium (basically Chrome, but without google branding - yay free software!)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.obsidianportal.com/profile/BlueWinds\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.obsidianportal.com/profile/BlueWinds</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T14:19:00-08:00","id":1004623,"title":"","content":"Yeah, the aspect ratio is a bit off, but it is usable in Chrome. This is what I see:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://db4sgowjqfwig.cloudfront.net/campaigns/151783/assets/664730/map4.jpg?1479421109\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> I added you to the campaign.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T14:55:39-08:00","id":1004656,"title":"","content":"The location tags didn't show up for me until just now, after I joined the campaign. I liked your earlier image better. :P<br /> <br /> Also, turns out that Aisa's long winded after all. Clear and concise is for people who are under time pressure rather than &quot;impress the rest of the nobility&quot; pressure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T15:01:14-08:00","id":1004659,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BlueWinds</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1004656#post1004656\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The location tags didn't show up for me until just now, after I joined the campaign. I liked your earlier image better. :P<br /> <br /> Also, turns out that Aisa's long winded after all. Clear and concise is for people who are under time pressure rather than &quot;impress the rest of the nobility&quot; pressure.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Can you try to add an NPC? If not, I can add everyone's NPCs and assign them to your Obsidian Portal account.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T15:19:57-08:00","id":1004673,"title":"","content":"It's not very obvious how to do so - the little + is right next to the &quot;Quick search&quot;, but yes, I just created V'neef Iphen. Will fill in some details on him later.<br /> <br /> I noticed we can also have character sheets on there - wondering if that might be an easy place for everyone to store theirs in all the same format?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T15:51:48-08:00","id":1004682,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BlueWinds</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1004673#post1004673\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's not very obvious how to do so - the little + is right next to the &quot;Quick search&quot;, but yes, I just created V'neef Iphen. Will fill in some details on him later.<br /> <br /> I noticed we can also have character sheets on there - wondering if that might be an easy place for everyone to store theirs in all the same format?</div> </div> </div> </div>I see him. I tagged him with &quot;<a href=\"https://scarletskyconspiracy.obsidianportal.com/search?tag=Mnemon+Aisa\" target=\"_blank\">Mnemon Aisa</a>&quot;, so when I click on the tag, it shows everything related to your character (Character background, Letters, NPCs, etc)<br /> <br /> I haven't played around with the Character Style Sheets on Obsidian Portal yet. Let's stick with the PDFs for now and I will poke at it more this weekend.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T17:24:18-08:00","id":1004716,"title":"","content":"Can't seem to figure out how to join the game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T17:42:26-08:00","id":1004721,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1004716#post1004716\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can't seem to figure out how to join the game.</div> </div> </div> </div>I sent you an invite.<br /> <br /> I also edited the map so it isn't all stretched out. We didn't need the West or the East anyways. :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T18:56:50-08:00","id":1004747,"title":"","content":"So turns out anybody can move those markers... sorry guys.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T19:04:18-08:00","id":1004752,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1004747#post1004747\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So turns out anybody can move those markers... sorry guys.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> What did you do?!? Did you touch it?!?! What did I tell you about touch things?!?<br /> <br /> Gods, it's not like we need to get banned from another library....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T19:11:27-08:00","id":1004753,"title":"","content":"Custom Terrestrial Craft charm for consideration:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Strike the Dragon-Anvil<br /> Cost: 6m, 1wp; Mins: Craft 5, Essence 3; Type: Reflexive<br /> Keywords: Combo-OK, Obvious<br /> Duration: Instant<br /> Prerequisite Charms: Shaping Hand Style<br /> Striking at a block of uncarved stone as if it were a foe upon the<br /> battle-field, the Dragon-Blood carves it into shape. This Charm<br /> can enhance any Craft-based action to build an object, dividing<br /> the time needed to complete each interval in half. If the Dragon-<br /> Blood is assisted by others who knows this Charm, they may<br /> activate it cooperatively. Each cooperative activation increases by<br /> one the factor that the time is divided by, to a maximum dividing<br /> factor of the higher of the crafting Dragon-Blood\u2019s (Essence<br /> or Breeding). For example, if the Dragon-Blood was assisted by<br /> one other character with this Charm, the time needed for each<br /> interval would be divided by three, while with two assisting characters,<br /> it would be divided by four.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T19:40:43-08:00","id":1004764,"title":"","content":"I'll look at it in the morning. I had quite a bit of mead. <br /> <br /> Also, you all have character pictures in Obsidian Portal. If you don't like it, change it. I just despise faceless grey dude.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T19:50:05-08:00","id":1004765,"title":"","content":"I moved them mostly back to the same spot, I was trying to move the map and accidently moved the red icon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T19:55:44-08:00","id":1004767,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1004765#post1004765\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I moved them mostly back to the same spot, I was trying to move the map and accidently moved the red icon.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was kidding. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T19:59:27-08:00","id":1004769,"title":"","content":"I meant to ask: Is it better to be in Dragonsmouth so as to avoid tripling up on the Imperial City?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T20:12:17-08:00","id":1004776,"title":"","content":"Your character and Ryo are the only ones in the Imperial City. Titus travels a lot. Ryo is probably going to be focusing on the Spiral and Deliberate. <br /> <br /> I just introduced the Imperial Manse because it is important to the game. Your character can poke at the Imperial Manse to his hearts content. He won't be able to open it until &quot;plot time&quot;, but he can interact with those interested in it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-18T07:08:56-08:00","id":1004919,"title":"","content":"It's Friday and the start of Resplendent Air's Week 2. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar9510_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"9510\" data-vbnamecard=\"9510\">BlueWinds</a> has already posted her letter. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3103_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3103\" data-vbnamecard=\"3103\">Eura</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1144_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1144\" data-vbnamecard=\"1144\">Exthalion</a> should have enough to start writing their letters. I'm still waiting on Dice rolls from <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4567\" data-vbnamecard=\"4567\">Volivat</a> and I haven't gotten any solid plans from <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2144_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2144\" data-vbnamecard=\"2144\">Guancyto</a> yet.<br /> <br /> If all the players could add important NPCs to the <a href=\"http://scarletskyconspiracy.obsidianportal.com/characters\" target=\"_blank\">Obsidian Portal site</a>, I'd greatly appreciate it. I'll add the Contenders to the throne this afternoon. <br /> <br /> I am going to be out of town starting on Tuesday, so I would like to get the GM's part cleared out before I go.<br /> <br /> Some thoughts about game play thus far:<br /> <br /> 1. The difficulties in the book are WAY too low. I suspected as much, but then Ryo almost botched on six dice. I am going to adjust the table for next in-game month, so you actually have a chance for failure.<br /> <br /> 2. A few players still need to realize that you are the ST of your location. I can supply ideas, but you are in control of your NPCs. This greatly increased the power of Allies, Contacts, Followers, etc. I may make some suggestions about how your NPCs may act, but ultimately y<b>ou</b> have control over these characters, not I. Thus why I make you roll when they do things.<br /> <br /> 3. Any suggestions on how to improve resolving actions? What did you think of the complications I came up with?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-18T08:41:12-08:00","id":1004966,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 1. The difficulties in the book are WAY too low. I suspected as much, but then Ryo almost botched on six dice. I am going to adjust the table for next in-game month, so you actually have a chance for failure. </div> </div> </div>So, there's a huge difference between Solar and Dragon Blooded difficulties. You'll notice that I failed two out of my four rolls - and these are some of the larger dice pools Aisa has, Int + Larceny. Occult and Lore, she can succeed on difficulty 5 rolls without too much fuss. Every other ability, diff 2-3 is her limit. There are several reasons for this.<ul><li>I couldn't buy 5 dots in abilities without spending bonus points, and spent many of my bonus points getting E3 and breeding, rather than on Abilities.</li> <li>I only get 7 charms instead of 10.</li> <li>The DB excellency is significantly weaker than the solar one, and its only advantage (mote efficiency) is completely negated in a game like this. And the weakness is exacerbated by not having Abilities at 5.</li> </ul><br /> <br /> Basically, I liked the fact that you were sticking to the core difficulties, because then I didn't feel pressured to buy an Excellency and five dots for every ability I wanted to succeed in. So I can understand the desire to have people fail... but the difficulties you gave were already appropriate to the character I built, and I'm already failing.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 2. A few players still need to realize that you are the ST of your location. I can supply ideas, but you are in control of your NPCs. This greatly increased the power of Allies, Contacts, Followers, etc. I may make some suggestions about how your NPCs may act, but ultimately y<b>ou</b> have control over these characters, not I. Thus why I make you roll when they do things. </div> </div> </div>It's hard to know the limits and OOC-mechanics of this. As an example, let's say I want (not I Aisa, but I BlueWinds) Cynis throw a turning-of-the-seasons party so I can meet important people and build reputation. Should I put this idea in the consult-with-ST-and-get-rolls-to-make post? How important of NPCs can I say show up? BIjar, who's working on a plot you dropped, because I want to meet her? Mnemon?<br /> <br /> I suspect this would be ok, and that mentioning &quot;I'd like this important thing to happen this month at my location&quot; is the right way to do it, but for me at least, it's going to take a little while to gain boldness in that direction, since it's different from many other games I've played in or run. I shall attempt to be more proactive next month. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-18T09:01:29-08:00","id":1004973,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BlueWinds</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1004966#post1004966\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So, there's a huge difference between Solar and Dragon Blooded difficulties. You'll notice that I failed two out of my four rolls - and these are some of the larger dice pools Aisa has, Int + Larceny. Occult and Lore, she can succeed on difficulty 5 rolls without too much fuss. Every other ability, diff 2-3 is her limit. There are several reasons for this.<ul><li>I couldn't buy 5 dots in abilities without spending bonus points, and spent many of my bonus points getting E3 and breeding, rather than on Abilities.</li> <li>I only get 7 charms instead of 10.</li> <li>The DB excellency is significantly weaker than the solar one, and its only advantage (mote efficiency) is completely negated in a game like this. And the weakness is exacerbated by not having Abilities at 5.</li> </ul><br /> Basically, I liked the fact that you were sticking to the core difficulties, because then I didn't feel pressured to buy an Excellency and five dots for every ability I wanted to succeed in. So I can understand the desire to have people fail... but the difficulties you gave were already appropriate to the character I built, and I'm already failing.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll have to think more on this. One of the other Dragonblooded players was blowing the difficulties out of the water. I didn't set too many limits on character creation, so this may be an issue of some players with ability focused characters and others with wider ability spread.<br /> <br /> Let's get other players opinions first.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BlueWinds</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1004966#post1004966\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's hard to know the limits and OOC-mechanics of this. As an example, let's say I want (not I Aisa, but I BlueWinds) Cynis throw a turning-of-the-seasons party so I can meet important people and build reputation. Should I put this idea in the consult-with-ST-and-get-rolls-to-make post? How important of NPCs can I say show up? BIjar, who's working on a plot you dropped, because I want to meet her? Mnemon?<br /> <br /> I suspect this would be ok, and that mentioning &quot;I'd like this important thing to happen this month at my location&quot; is the right way to do it, but for me at least, it's going to take a little while to gain boldness in that direction, since it's different from many other games I've played in or run. I shall attempt to be more proactive next month. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Basically, you can do whatever you want in your little corner of Creation within the guidelines I set for progression. You (BlueWinds) can create situations like a Cynis party at will. You (Aisa) can attempt to make a good impression at the party. That is where I come in and make Aisa's life difficult. &quot;You are young, so everyone important blows you off. You got to find a way to make yourself heard.&quot; You can also suggest difficulties. &quot;Aisa is trying to make a good impression, but Iphren just wants to unwind and get drunk.&quot;<br /> <br /> I see my job as ST in this type of game as three parts. One, to shepherd the game so we don't get too far off the main plot of taking the throne. Two, to make sure no one goes &quot;I get everything I want and I win.&quot; Three, to metaphorically kick the game table when things get dull. I have a few major events planned to shake things up.<br /> <br /> I figured it would take a few letters for everyone to get comfortable with this game format. You are a little ST in your location. I'm just here to cause you character problems. :P<br /> <br /> On the Imperial Manse, I'm not really dropping that plot, but rather passing it off to Exthalion's character. Also, Aisa' plan to deal with the slaves works pretty well for solving Ryo's issue (Better than the idea I had). Feel free to harvest any of Ryo's plots for your own plot. I may joke about him being a GM-PC, but his character's job is to feed your characters information and ideas.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-18T09:21:28-08:00","id":1004976,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1004973#post1004973\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'll have to think more on this. One of the other Dragonblooded players was blowing the difficulties out of the water. I didn't set too many limits on character creation, so this may be an issue of some players with ability focused characters and others with wider ability spread.<br /> <br /> Let's get other players opinions first.</div> </div> </div> </div>Just wanted to point out that not <i>everyone </i>was blowing rolls out of the water. Aisa will totally wreck any lore or occult rolls, where she's focused - but she wants to make all kinds of rolls, not just those. You'll note that's where I failed - rolls that didn't match my &quot;main&quot; abilities. So my preferred solution would be that if people are having too easy a time confront them with obstacles they don't have 5 dots and an excellency in! Make the characters uncomfortable and out of their depth. This lets us be awesome in our specialties, but like real people, we're not good at everything.<br /> <br /> But yeah, definitely want to hear what other players think. Just putting my thoughts out there.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> On the Imperial Manse, I'm not really dropping that plot, but rather passing it off to Exthalion's character. Also, Aisa' plan to deal with the slaves works pretty well for solving Ryo's issue (Better than the idea I had). Feel free to harvest any of Ryo's plots for your own plot. I may joke about him being a GM-PC, but his character's job is to feed your characters information and ideas. </div> </div> </div>That's how I figured it was going to go, given his intro. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Aisa will still involve herself a little more, but as a stepping stone to V'Neef rather than a personal focus.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-18T09:34:47-08:00","id":1004983,"title":"","content":"In terms of difficulties, its pretty tricky to go beyond 3 difficulties in non-focused areas. Like my ally screwed up his role in my plot by not getting any successes with a 6 dice pool for a diff 2 roll.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat","name":"Volivat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-18T09:42:50-08:00","id":1004985,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Volivat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1004983#post1004983\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In terms of difficulties, its pretty tricky to go beyond 3 difficulties in non-focused areas. Like my ally screwed up his role in my plot by not getting any successes with a 6 dice pool for a diff 2 roll.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Ryo's Integrity Roll was diff 2 with a six die pool. Thankfully, I spent some willpower or else it would have been a botch and Bijar would have grown suspicious of our poor accountant. <br /> <br /> I'm leaning towards keeping the difficulty table the same and working with the other player on custom difficulties for certain rolls. My mind may change later if other players chime in. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-18T09:45:00-08:00","id":1004986,"title":"","content":"Darnit, completely forgot i could use WP when using my ally. Yeah, his roll was a botch. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat","name":"Volivat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-18T09:50:35-08:00","id":1004990,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Volivat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1004986#post1004986\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Darnit, completely forgot i could use WP when using my ally. Yeah, his roll was a botch.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It was a botch. shit. Did you want me to update you on the results of your rolls here or in PM?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-18T10:06:45-08:00","id":1005002,"title":"","content":"PM, probably better for keeping this thread coherent","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat","name":"Volivat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-18T10:31:31-08:00","id":1005018,"title":"","content":"PM has been sent.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-18T11:43:54-08:00","id":1005043,"title":"","content":"I was rolling insane because I'm amazing at two things, performance and martial arts. Make me roll anything else and I'm meh. Because of how the character works I'm going to make things about performance if I can, meaning don't fuck with the theatre troupe master in her theatre. If you noticed I delegated as often as I could because I could have easily failed that stealth roll.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-18T12:09:57-08:00","id":1005050,"title":"","content":"Question, what would be the approximate level of a hearthstone that let you regain virtue channels in some fashion? Since the Solar Charm, PRT, lets you do it whenever you would regain WP, I figure this one might only allow it with a stunt.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-18T12:10:26-08:00","id":1005052,"title":"","content":"I think this is an issue of play style that this format of game exaggerates. Some people are going to play their character's strength's. Others are going to stretch what their character is capable of and sometimes fail. I had this issue in my old pathfinder game. I had one player who was really good a building super powerful characters. Everyone else played normal powered characters. <br /> <br /> So I am going to suggest doing what we did in my old pathfinder game. I don't like to punish players for building awesome characters. I rather reward players for taking risks. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> I'm not going to adjust the difficulty for the game. If you are throwing 20 dice for a roll, you aren't going to get anything special for the extra successes. If you are only sending in scenarios that play to your character's strengths, well then you succeed. <br /> <br /> However, if you do start reaching beyond your character's niche, the stars above may align to help you succeed. When you solve a complication using an ability with three or less dots, you will receive an astrological blessing for that roll. I haven't figured out the details on what the blessing will be yet, as I need to refresh myself on the Astrology section of the Sidereal book. <br /> <br /> I am unsure if I am going to extend this to Ally rolls yet. Mostly because I don't have character sheets for your allies. <br /> <br /> Does that sound fair for everyone?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-18T12:14:18-08:00","id":1005055,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1005050#post1005050\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Question, what would be the approximate level of a hearthstone that let you regain virtue channels in some fashion? Since the Solar Charm, PRT, lets you do it whenever you would regain WP, I figure this one might only allow it with a stunt.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> What Aspect is your Hearthstone again?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-18T12:30:33-08:00","id":1005061,"title":"","content":"This sounds fair to me, in the upcoming weeks I wont have the luxury of having everything come to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-18T13:05:29-08:00","id":1005073,"title":"","content":"Ill have my letter up tomorrow, stuck on the demon for now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat","name":"Volivat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-18T13:07:03-08:00","id":1005074,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> 