"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Guancyto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1005368#post1005368\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ack, sorry, had a lot going on. I will get you actions promptly!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> No worries. I set up the schedule for busy people. I just want to warn people I'm going out of town. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-20T11:58:14-08:00","id":1005788,"title":"","content":"I didn't name or describe the elementals sent to all your locations. They're now NPCs in your areas, so feel free to do with them what you will (including ignore them).<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4567\" data-vbnamecard=\"4567\">Volivat</a> - Ai<i><b>s</b></i>a, not Ai<b><i>sh</i></b>a. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-20T13:20:50-08:00","id":1005831,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BlueWinds</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1005788#post1005788\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I didn't name or describe the elementals sent to all your locations. They're now NPCs in your areas, so feel free to do with them what you will (including ignore them).<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4567\" data-vbnamecard=\"4567\">Volivat</a> - Ai<i><b>s</b></i>a, not Ai<b><i>sh</i></b>a. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I could swear I saw Aisha somewhere... Ill get it right next time :P<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat","name":"Volivat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-21T12:45:46-08:00","id":1006340,"title":"","content":"So, I was thinking about the way it takes a really long time for our rather minimal character interactions to play out, and was wondering the ST's opinion on &quot;supplementary letters&quot; or something.<br /> Limit one per character between each &quot;main&quot; letter, so that we don't flood the IC thread with chatter (and because it takes a while for mail to be delivered across Creation), but it would give us a chance to do things like talk about &quot;how do we accomplish our goals&quot; at a slightly faster pace than once-per-IC-month.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-21T13:05:42-08:00","id":1006354,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BlueWinds</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1006340#post1006340\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, I was thinking about the way it takes a really long time for our rather minimal character interactions to play out, and was wondering the ST's opinion on &quot;supplementary letters&quot; or something.<br /> Limit one per character between each &quot;main&quot; letter, so that we don't flood the IC thread with chatter (and because it takes a while for mail to be delivered across Creation), but it would give us a chance to do things like talk about &quot;how do we accomplish our goals&quot; at a slightly faster pace than once-per-IC-month.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I've been thinking the same thing. Since Aisa sent everyone Air Elementals, I'd say it take a week or so for someone to receive a letter. Thus at most you can send out four different letters a month. I'd prefer not to extend the schedule for two real life weeks per in game month while at the same time, not require people to write multiple letters if they don't have time. Just because you send a letter doesn't mean the other person has to answer it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> As ST, I just want one set of actions to send to me per month of game play. But I don't want to hold the characters back from plotting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 11-21-2016, 04:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-21T13:43:16-08:00","id":1006377,"title":"","content":"I may be harassing our crafter in a few weeks when I go looking for the lost warstriders in the north.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-21T14:14:02-08:00","id":1006387,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1006377#post1006377\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I may be harassing our crafter in a few weeks when I go looking for the lost warstriders in the north.</div> </div> </div> </div>With any luck, I will have completed my grand master plan to get access to speed boosters by then. The best I can do, as far as I calculated, is about 5 days per roll. At that point the lack of infrastructure to keep me supplied becomes the real issue.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Oh, wonderandawe, I meant to ask. I have been using my backing with the assumption that I can call on House resources for my projects so long as there is a decent explanation for why its good for the House. I think I might have enough dots that I don't have much oversight, but is it reasonable to assume I can have Ledaal sorcerers occasionally summon me some demons to help craft or use the endless wealth of Ledaal to subsidize my artificing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-21T14:23:52-08:00","id":1006393,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1006387#post1006387\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, wonderandawe, I meant to ask. I have been using my backing with the assumption that I can call on House resources for my projects so long as there is a decent explanation for why its good for the House. I think I might have enough dots that I don't have much oversight, but is it reasonable to assume I can have Ledaal sorcerers occasionally summon me some demons to help craft or use the endless wealth of Ledaal to subsidize my artificing?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, at your backing, you have been supplied a large workshop with many assistants. You can subsidize your artificing, but any artifact you create with your backing with technically be property of House Ledaal. In actual game terms, that doesn't mean much, but I will keep it in mind for a possible complication. <br /> <br /> I may have to redo some dots on Ryo's character sheet. At his backing, I didn't need to buy followers for him. I'm going to relocate that point to reso