userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-21T16:36:34-08:00","id":1006461,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BlueWinds</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1006459#post1006459\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Titus got off light this month - Aisa was busy with other things, and she wanted to reveal something personal about herself to see if he responded with trust in kind. Next month though, next month he can expect an <i>investigation </i>if he doesn't explain some more about himself.</div> </div> </div> </div>I really want to post the letter now, but I will be patient and wait for <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2144_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2144\" data-vbnamecard=\"2144\">Guancyto</a>'s letter first. <br /> <br /> I hope Aisa makes Titus regret this letter. But I also hope Titus' letter makes Aisa think a few things over.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-21T16:39:52-08:00","id":1006463,"title":"","content":"I think I'm seeing a little Mnemon in Aisa.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-21T19:17:06-08:00","id":1006508,"title":"","content":"I am going to be leaving rather early tomorrow morning, so I went ahead and posted Titus' letter. He laid into Aisa a bit quite a bit. I'm very curious on her reaction. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2144_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2144\" data-vbnamecard=\"2144\">Guancyto</a>, You can still post your letter for Resplendent Air. It's not late. I just wouldn't be able to post Titus' letter before the end of the week. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> Over our break, I would appreciate it if everyone could add any important to your character NPCs to the <a href=\"https://scarletskyconspiracy.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Obsidian Portal site</a>. They don't even have to be NPCs on your Character sheet. I need to start keeping track of some ST things and want to use the Obsidian Portal site to do so. <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4567\" data-vbnamecard=\"4567\">Volivat</a> Send me your Obsidian Portal user name and I will add you to the campaign.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 11-21-2016, 10:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-21T20:09:16-08:00","id":1006527,"title":"","content":"I can't stop laughing. Aisa's reaction is so very clear in my mind.<div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><br /> 1) Read the letter.<br /> 2) Go review the <i>precise </i>wording of her oath regarding the conspiracy.<br /> 3) Smile.<br /> 4) <img src=\"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcT9D1Ebt5qhEDluEq2-yCOWWo70i3X_bj0YNHz8HZYRyuoi1lwccQ\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>(censored)<br /> 5) Ask a servant for a cup of tea and go back to reading her book.</div>Titus is doomed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"Bl