/> <br /> Also, yeah, not really going to murder him - mostly just joking around OOC because fierce little Aisa is completely adorable.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:9px\">(I may have slightly messed up sensibilities about what's adorable, but :shrug, giggle: )</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-23T23:23:14-08:00","id":1007589,"title":"","content":"Was that Titus letter to him only? Because poor little Akashan might feel a tad snubbed at being left out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-24T01:47:35-08:00","id":1007615,"title":"","content":"We were actually close to NPC vs NPC action. <br /> <br /> Ryo upon reading Titus' letter:<br /> <img src=\"http://facebookcommentimages.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/fb-sticker-bun.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> (and by action, I mean a strongly worded letter. Which wouldn't be too frightening, except Ryo is an Eclipse.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wond