:"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-27T11:59:31-08:00","id":1008991,"title":"","content":"I think we're waiting on the ST to drop Ryu's next letter, and send us into the next set of goals / obstacles / letter writing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-27T12:54:04-08:00","id":1009013,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BlueWinds</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1008991#post1008991\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think we're waiting on the ST to drop Ryu's next letter, and send us into the next set of goals / obstacles / letter writing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah. I just got back home. I'll drop the next Ryo letter today or tomorrow.<br /> <br /> I also need to give out XP/Backgrounds for Resplendent Air. I'll have that up tonight so you can start buying things. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 11-27-2016, 04:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-27T16:37:03-08:00","id":1009082,"title":"","content":"XP is done and the <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1ZCFTahn26VdjhdpHZ69kyAkG2yRiEYAt67-5GDmSP10\" target=\"_blank\">Backgrounds and Experience Spreadsheet</a> has been updated with XP/Backgrounds. Please look it over and let me know if I got any of your backgrounds wrong. PM me your XP purchases and I will add it to the sheet. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> XP totals thus far:<br /> <br /> <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/993606-interest-check-realm-civil-war-play-by-post-epistolary-game-ex2?p=993730#post993730\">Mnemon Aisa - BlueWinds</a></b><br /> Dragonblooded - Air Aspect<br /> Heptagram, Isle of Voices, Blessed Isle<br /> <b>XP Spent/Total: 0/12</b><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/993606-interest-check-realm-civil-war-play-by-post-epistolary-game-ex2?p=993945#post993945\"><b>Ferem \u200bQuelaana - Eura</b></a><br /> Dragonblooded - Wood Aspect<br /> Cheraki, North<br /> <b>XP Spent/Total: 8/12</b><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/993606-interest-check-realm-civil-war-play-by-post-epistolary-game-ex2?p=994032#post994032\"><b>Whispering Twilight - Volivat</b></a><br /> Solar - Twilight<br /> House of Bells, Arjuf, Blessed Isle<br /> <b>XP Spent/Total: 0/12</b><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/993606-interest-check-realm-civil-war-play-by-post-epistolary-game-ex2?p=995021#post995021\"><b>Ledaal Catala Akashan - Exthalion</b></a><br /> Dragonblooded - Air Aspect<br /> Imperial City, Blessed Isle<br /> <b>XP Spent/Total: 0/12</b><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/993606-interest-check-realm-civil-war-play-by-post-epistolary-game-ex2?p=995357#post995357\"><b>Contarini Carmela - Guancyto</b></a><br /> Dragonblooded - Fire Aspect<br /> Pahua Basin, Blessed Isle<br /> <b>XP Spent/Total: 0/12</b><br /> <br /> <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/993606-interest-check-realm-civil-war-play-by-post-epistolary-game-ex2?p=993682#post993682\">Nellens Ryo - Wonderandawe</a></b><br /> Solar - Eclipse<br /> Imperial City, Blessed Isle<br /> <b>XP Spent/Total: 8/12</b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-27T16:40:42-08:00","id":1009084,"title":"","content":"<u><b>Astrology Bonus</b></u><br /> <br /> For any ability 3 and under, you roll success on 6s. <br /> <br /> I'm going to test this out on Ryo, who will be forced to speak at his first visit to the Imperial Deliberate. Ryo has no points in Presence, so this should be interesting. :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-27T18:17:17-08:00","id":1009106,"title":"","content":"Ryo's letters are up. For someone who is suppose to be really good at Bureaucracy, Ryo rolls really low. I don't know what he would do without the second Solar excellency. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Ryo didn't roll a single six in either of his Astrology augmented rolls. Maybe my curse of &quot;never rolling well as an ST&quot; is haunting me.<br /> <br /> <br /> I adjusted the calendar to start the planning early. We will begin to write letters on 12/9/2016. I figured that will give everyone time to come up with a solid strategy for the conspiracy as mentioned in the past letters.<br /> <br /> How does everyone feel about the schedule? I created it so those who visit the forums less regularly can plan for letters and what not. I'm also trying to balance this game with work and my quest.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 11-28-2016, 11:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-27T19:52:14-08:00","id":1009135,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3950_2.gif');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3950\" data-vbnamecard=\"3950\">wonderandawe</a> - What are your views on IC knowledge of Essence ratings? My view has always been that essence ratings are fairly well known among the dynasty - not as a hard number, but definitely as a &quot;oh yes, she's very in tune with the dragons for her age, her anima is very strong.&quot; I know that different people have their own views, so I wanted to check in before I start making plans.<br /> <br /> (currently debating whether to go straight for E4 or stop and get some more excellencies first)<br /> <br /> The current schedule is fine by me. The Thanksgiving break was a little long (I'm excited to play!), but I understand other people being busy even if I wasn't.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":9510,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","user":"BlueWinds","date":". 11-27-2016, 10:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-27T19:56:24-08:00","id":1009136,"title":"","content":"There is no number mentioned but an essence four Dragonblooded is obviously more powerful than an essence two. At higher essence, you will get more elemental effects in your Anima.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-27T20:08:00-08:00","id":1009140,"title":"","content":"After playing a sidereal for over a year the target number 6 thing is a subtle bonus that eeks out one or two extra successes on rolls with a decent number already. If you want to help low dice pools your better off lowering the difficulty, I don't think that'd feel too rewarding to do &quot; you're not good at this ability, here let me lower the difficulty.&quot; So as a whole I like the target number 6 thing more for this game design wise.<br /> <br /> I could easily pick up the pace for a faster schedule being unemployed and all (interview Monday keep your fingers crossed), but I don't want a faster schedule to force people out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-28T07:03:35-08:00","id":1009314,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1009140#post1009140\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">After playing a sidereal for over a year the target number 6 thing is a subtle bonus that eeks out one or two extra successes on rolls with a decent number already. If you want to help low dice pools your better off lowering the difficulty, I don't think that'd feel too rewarding to do &quot; you're not good at this ability, here let me lower the difficulty.&quot; So as a whole I like the target number 6 thing more for this game design wise.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm confused. Are you saying that you prefer the lower difficulty, because the target number 6 isn't useful for small dice pools. Yet you still like the target number 6 for this game format?<br /> <br /> My thought process on the Astrology Bonus: I'm trying to give players who take risks bonuses on their rolls. However, I don't want to create a situation where &quot;Oh, I don't want to raise my ability to four because then I'll lose my bonus.&quot; <br /> <br /> I'm willing to adjust the bonus if it doesn't have the intended effect of helping risk taking players.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 11-28-2016, 10:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-28T14:48:39-08:00","id":1009492,"title":"","content":"I'm saying I like the target number 6 bonus because the lower difficulty is easier to game. it also makes a random excellency in a worse skill feel better since mote efficiency isn't a big deal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-28T14:51:32-08:00","id":1009494,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1009492#post1009492\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm saying I like the target number 6 bonus because the lower difficulty is easier to game. it also makes a random excellency in a worse skill feel better since mote efficiency isn't a big deal.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Ah. In case I agree with that. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-28T17:44:59-08:00","id":1009569,"title":"","content":"FYI <br /> <br /> You can start sending me your plans for Descending Air. Or you can discuss among yourselves what your characters should do next. I'm kind of leaving the big strategy up to the PCs. Ryo's plan was for everyone to make friends with the different factions and play each faction off of each other.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-28T21:21:12-08:00","id":1009630,"title":"","content":"Well, Ryo is in the process of giving Carmela a nice cover for building herself a private legion, so that's about the size of her short-term goals. (I wonder if 'Magisterial Legions' has a nice ring to it.)<br /> <br /> Actually dealing with the mystery of the sorcerer and bolstering the Magistracy is a bonus, but a nice one if it happens that way, if people want to help with that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto","user":"Guancyto","date":". 11-29-2016, 12:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto","name":"Guancyto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"699"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T10:18:10-08:00","id":1009843,"title":"","content":"I've been updating the <a href=\"https://scarletskyconspiracy.obsidianportal.com/wikis/main-page\" target=\"_blank\">Obsidian Portal Wiki</a>. Added a page for <a href=\"https://scarletskyconspiracy.obsidianportal.com/wikis/items\" target=\"_blank\">Items</a>, <a href=\"https://scarletskyconspiracy.obsidianportal.com/wikis/timeline\" target=\"_blank\">Timeline</a>, <a href=\"https://scarletskyconspiracy.obsidianportal.com/wikis/sidereal-astrology-bonuses\" target=\"_blank\">Astrology Bonus</a>, and <a href=\"https://scarletskyconspiracy.obsidianportal.com/wikis/custom-charms\" target=\"_blank\">Custom charms</a>. I moved the <a href=\"https://scarletskyconspiracy.obsidianportal.com/wikis/experience-and-backgrounds\" target=\"_blank\">Experience and Background </a>to its own page. <br /> <br /> Soon, I will start creating everyone's NPCs. I need to start tracking some ST related information about your NPCs, so I want to put them in the system. I may be bugging you about NPC names and splats soon. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T11:35:39-08:00","id":1009875,"title":"","content":"Jokes on you I already added my Henchmen","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T11:37:12-08:00","id":1009876,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1009875#post1009875\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Jokes on you I already added my Henchmen</div> </div> </div> </div>With pictures even! And I thank up for it. <br /> <br /> Which NPC is the one you want to Exalt?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T11:45:22-08:00","id":1009879,"title":"","content":"Either Rei/Ronin or Mai/Dragon-blooded, I haven't decided yet. Mai has breeding and acts heroic occasionally but Rei seems Siderealy the more I think of her concept/history.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T12:00:35-08:00","id":1009882,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1009879#post1009879\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Either Rei/Ronin or Mai/Dragon-blooded, I haven't decided yet. Mai has breeding and acts heroic occasionally but Rei seems Siderealy the more I think of her concept/history.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I am unsure about Rei becoming a Sidereal as when she Exalts you will have to roll Integrity to see if you still remember her.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T12:22:16-08:00","id":1009890,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar9510_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"9510\" data-vbnamecard=\"9510\">BlueWinds</a> Iphen is a Wood Aspect Correct?<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4567\" data-vbnamecard=\"4567\">Volivat</a> What aspect is Ledaal Darino? I also need a name for your scholarly Ledaal Contact. <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2144_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2144\" data-vbnamecard=\"2144\">Guancyto</a> Is Magistrate Geno a Dragonblooded or mortal? If Dragonblooded, what aspect is he?<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1144_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1144\" data-vbnamecard=\"1144\">Exthalion</a> I need names for your Jadeborne ally and his mentor.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3103_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3103\" data-vbnamecard=\"3103\">Eura</a> Is your character's name Quelaana Ferem or Ferem Quelaana? I've been using the Realm naming of Family Name then Given Name, but I can switch it around if needed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 11-29-2016, 05:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T12:44:59-08:00","id":1009896,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1009882#post1009882\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I am unsure about Rei becoming a Sidereal as when she Exalts you will have to roll Integrity to see if you still remember her.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's weird because Quelaana has known her for at least a year and it's never really clear how long it takes for acquaintances to form. It might be cool if Rei get's her own side quest during that time though. That said, Mai is all about the idea of being exalted whether she is or not and is more likely to get into unnecessary situations just to be heroic.<br /> <br /> That's why I'm undecided, Rei has cool plot implications but Mai deserves it more.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T12:53:32-08:00","id":1009903,"title":"","content":"oh, you mean Rei is currently a Sidereal. Not going to Exalt as a Sidereal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T13:03:38-08:00","id":1009909,"title":"","content":"I wrote her Stats as mortal, I mean &quot;revealing&quot; her as a Ronin the whole time isn't a half bad idea though.<br /> <br /> P.S. Ferem is Quelaana's Family name. There's some weird behind the scenes lore on that family name, but it's the only canon one in Cherak and it works for me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3103,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","user":"Eura","date":". 11-29-2016, 04:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T13:18:23-08:00","id":1009914,"title":"","content":"If Rei exalts as a Sidereal during game play, you are going to have to roll Integrity to see if you keep your memories of her. Your past associate with her will not count for the purposes of becoming an Acquaintances. You will have to rebuild a relationship with Rei after her Exaltation.<br /> <br /> It's harsh, but Arcane Fate is a bitch.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T13:32:20-08:00","id":1009919,"title":"","content":"That sounds fair, it also might give Titus a heart attack. Wait, I couldn't write about her in a letter because she wouldn't have a destiny. The inability to troll Titus saddens me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T13:39:05-08:00","id":1009921,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1009919#post1009919\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That sounds fair, it also might give Titus a heart attack. Wait, I couldn't write about her in a letter because she wouldn't have a destiny. The inability to troll Titus saddens me.</div> </div> </div> </div>I love when players react to an NPC just as planned. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> Do you want me to file your character under Quelaana Ferem or Ferem Quelaana?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T13:43:09-08:00","id":1009923,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1009890#post1009890\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1144_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1144\" data-vbnamecard=\"1144\">Exthalion</a> I need names for your Jadeborne ally and his mentor.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ally: Ascending Stratum<br /> Mentor: Fulminous Heart<br /> <br /> The real funny thing is that all of us who know about Sids form the Heptogram can't talk about it because magic. The best we could do would probably do is indicate it obliquely by talking about &quot;those things at the Heptogram you can't talk about&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 11-29-2016, 04:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T13:48:31-08:00","id":1009925,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1009923#post1009923\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The real funny thing is that all of us who know about Sids form the Heptogram can't talk about it because magic. The best we could do would probably do is indicate it obliquely by talking about &quot;those things at the Heptogram you can't talk about&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>I haven't forgotten about this. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T14:28:02-08:00","id":1009938,"title":"","content":"I think I got everyone's NPCs (not including any new NPCs introduced for Descending Air). Let me know if I am missing any. Feel free to edit details and change the picture for the NPC. All the stuff I need for the NPC is in the GM section you can't see. <br /> <br /> <u><b>Quelaana</b></u><br /> <a href=\"https://scarletskyconspiracy.obsidianportal.com/characters/mai\" target=\"_blank\">Mai</a><br /> <a href=\"https://scarletskyconspiracy.obsidianportal.com/characters/rei\" target=\"_blank\">Rei</a><br /> <a href=\"https://scarletskyconspiracy.obsidianportal.com/characters/yuuta\" target=\"_blank\">Yuuta</a><br /> <a href=\"https://scarletskyconspiracy.obsidianportal.com/characters/tepet-ejava-the-roseblack\" targe