 b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1010007#post1010007\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I suppose you do. Aisa will get V'Neef.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is she going to start digging up the founders of Great Houses so she can collect them all?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T19:01:44-08:00","id":1010028,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1010026#post1010026\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Is she going to start digging up the founders of Great Houses so she can collect them all?</div> </div> </div> </div>Probably not, since she isn't a Dragon of a different color. <br /> <br /> <br /> If the NPC isn't on your character sheet, you don't really &quot;own&quot; them. They are most likely obstacles to your character. I changed the ownership so you can edit the NPCs on the site.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T19:55:28-08:00","id":1010038,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1009890#post1009890\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2144_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2144\" data-vbnamecard=\"2144\">Guancyto</a> Is Magistrate Geno a Dragonblooded or mortal? If Dragonblooded, what aspect is he?</div> </div> </div> </div>My notion is that he is a Water-Aspect Dragon-Blood. (Let me know if that bumps him up on the Ally scale, as that will affect whether or not I can add him to my sheet this week.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto","name":"Guancyto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"699"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-30T06:44:11-08:00","id":1010180,"title":"","content":"Let's keep him at Ally 2. His political power is localized to his area and he doesn't have any cool stuff you can learn from him.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-01T08:41:38-08:00","id":1010671,"title":"","content":"I've heard from everyone but <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4567\" data-vbnamecard=\"4567\">Volivat</a> so far. We got extra time this week for the letters, but it seems everyone is starting to get a good grasp on what they can do in their area. I'm a bit under the weather right now, but I will still try to answer your messages. <br /> <br /> There have been some questions about refresh. I got some House Rules in mind for Essence, Willpower, Virtue, Resources refresh. I am still musing on them in my cold med drugged mind. <br /> <br /> Basically Essence refreshes once a month and Willpower and Virtues refresh once a season. Resources may refresh either once a month or once a season. What do you think?<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-02T04:28:21-08:00","id":1011010,"title":"","content":"I added Hymn of Solace, I gave him a really cool Panoply charm to fit how he operates. My only question to the essence recovery is will anima flux stay the same? Our solar would actually run the risk of being exposed if he wants to abuse his OP charms.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-05T05:13:06-08:00","id":1012503,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1011010#post1011010\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I added Hymn of Solace, I gave him a really cool Panoply charm to fit how he operates. My only question to the essence recovery is will anima flux stay the same? Our solar would actually run the risk of being exposed if he wants to abuse his OP charms.</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, that is a design feature. The Solars can't abuse their OP charms due to being hidden and the Dragonblooded can freely abuse their less powerful charms. It's a way to even out the power level of the game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-05T05:33:44-08:00","id":1012514,"title":"","content":"More reasons for Sidereals to be strong in this type of gameplay. Soft presence practice is amazing for squeaking out all your motes subtly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3103,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","user":"Eura","date":". 12-05-2016, 08:36 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-05T05:35:41-08:00","id":1012516,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1012514#post1012514\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">More reasons for Sidereals to be strong in the type of gameplay. Soft presence practice is amazing for squeaking out all your motes subtly.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yet no one decided to play a Sidereal. *shrug*<br /> <br /> Oh well. All the secrets belong to the ST. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-05T05:53:54-08:00","id":1012522,"title":"","content":"I've been playing a Sidereal for over a year now in the modern exalted game. Besides I like playing a Dragon-blooded where I'm not at a disadvantage because everyone is a solaroid.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-05T08:36:37-08:00","id":1012601,"title":"","content":"I always like being Dragon Blooded! Celestials think their toys are the shiniest, but that just means we have to be twice as smart. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-05T10:24:54-08:00","id":1012651,"title":"","content":"Or spend three times as much. Money, like close air support, covers a multitude of sins.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-06T08:55:21-08:00","id":1013205,"title":"","content":"Been swamped these last 2 weeks, but back again now. <br /> <br /> volivat is the usernamer on obsidian, also the post which my char name is linked to in the 1 post of this tread, so it shows a link to my ally.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat","name":"Volivat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-06T08:57:31-08:00","id":1013209,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Volivat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1013205#post1013205\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Been swamped these last 2 weeks, but back again now.<br /> <br /> volivat is the usernamer on obsidian, also the post which my char name is linked to in the 1 post of this tread, so it shows a link to my ally.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> No worries, I set up the schedule for people with busy lives. Go ahead and send me your stuff this week for Descending Air. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> Added you to the campaign. I'll take a look at the post link this afternoon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-06T09:08:39-08:00","id":1013214,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1013209#post1013209\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> No worries, I set up the schedule for people with busy lives. Go ahead and send me your stuff this week for Descending Air. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Added you to the campaign. I'll take a look at the post link this afternoon.</div> </div> </div> </div>Good to hear<br /> <br /> Contacts name is Kebok Taite<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat","name":"Volivat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-06T09:14:15-08:00","id":1013215,"title":"","content":"I updated the contact with his name. Feel Free to change any of the character images I assigned to your characters and add any details to their profile (all the details I need are in the hidden GM section). You have a better idea than I of what your NPCs look like. (I just wanted the website to look pretty. lol)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-08T07:12:08-08:00","id":1014299,"title":"","content":"So I have been trying to sort out the whole &quot;Sorcerers know about Sidereals&quot; thing. According to the forum, the gag order on Sorcerers may be Fanon. Basically, the Exalted Fan Collective decided that if Sorcerers knew about Sidereals and could talk about Sidereals, then Sidereals would be well know. So we can go about this two different ways:<br /> <br /> 1. We have the Sorcerers and other Occult students be under the influence of Corrupted Words (White Treatise, pg 41). <br /> <br /> 2. Sorcerers and the like don't like revealing their secret Occult knowledge and no one wants to be the sorcerer who reveals the secret of Sidereals to the Realm. In this case, we use social pressures to keep knowledge of the Sidereals from becoming well known. <br /> <br /> I want to get your thoughts about this before we decide how to proceed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-08T08:49:32-08:00","id":1014330,"title":"","content":"Corrupted words can be ended with countermagic - which, given that we're literally talking about sorcerers as a class, makes it a very poor guarantee. I could see a Celestial spell with somewhat similar, though far more subtle, effect - rather than maggots it would simply cut off the desire at the source, such that one never even thinks about sharing the information. More secret, more sidereal, more secure.<br /> <br /> Honestly though, I like the idea of social pressure more. One does not share it because it's part of the secrets that only sorcerers are meant to know. Aisa for one would love that, and consider herself bound to keep the knowledge from the rest of the conspiracy - though she'll still hound Titus until he 'fesses up in private, if not in public.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-08T08:58:20-08:00","id":1014332,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BlueWinds</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1014330#post1014330\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Corrupted words can be ended with countermagic - which, given that we're literally talking about sorcerers as a class, makes it a very poor guarantee. I could see a Celestial spell with somewhat similar, though far more subtle, effect - rather than maggots it would simply cut off the desire at the source, such that one never even thinks about sharing the information. More secret, more sidereal, more secure.<br /> <br /> Honestly though, I like the idea of social pressure more. One does not share it because it's part of the secrets that only sorcerers are meant to know. Aisa for one would love that, and consider herself bound to keep the knowledge from the rest of the conspiracy - though she'll still hound Titus until he 'fesses up in private, if not in public.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> We also need to decide if we what the conspiracy as a whole to know about Sidereals or just to keep it between Titus, Aisa, and Akashan. (Ryo doesn't know about Sidereals.) I want to try to avoid having a conspiracy within a conspiracy if possible (Too much of a headache.) I have a way to partly reveal Sidereals without Aisa and Akashan compromising their mysterious sorcerous image.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-08T10:23:16-08:00","id":1014363,"title":"","content":"Aisa's ultimatum could be construed as asking permission to reveal SIdereals - &quot;Hey, Titus, tell everyone else about yourself because I don't want secrets in this conspiracy.&quot; She's already provided a way without compromising her own image, and if Titus takes her threat seriously, he has plausible denial for other sidereals - &quot;yeah, I was going to get murderized by this ambitious Mnemon girl if I didn't say something, and she probably would have spilled the beans herself.&quot; <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-08T10:26:03-08:00","id":1014367,"title":"","content":"The funny thing is I don't think Quelaana would reveal the existence of Sidereals just so one of Mai's conspiracy theories isn't proven right. She'd have to live with an eternity of &quot;but the fate chosen was real, why not this?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-08T10:41:09-08:00","id":1014375,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BlueWinds</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1014363#post1014363\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Aisa's ultimatum could be construed as asking permission to reveal SIdereals - &quot;Hey, Titus, tell everyone else about yourself because I don't want secrets in this conspiracy.&quot; She's already provided a way without compromising her own image, and if Titus takes her threat seriously, he has plausible denial for other sidereals - &quot;yeah, I was going to get murderized by this ambitious Mnemon girl if I didn't say something, and she probably would have spilled the beans herself.&quot; <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <img src=\"https://c1.staticflickr.com/1/357/18064277163_ffda5b89b1_o.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/> We will see when Titus' letter comes out.<br /> <br /> ((I should note that Titus' letter will come out after everyone posts theirs.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 12-08-2016, 02:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-08T12:30:26-08:00","id":1014411,"title":"","content":"Unless everyone is holding their letter until Titus' response?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-08T13:19:54-08:00","id":1014434,"title":"","content":"I have my letter written, was just waiting for the 9th, which is when &quot;letter writing week&quot; starts according to the calendar. Can post that now (not wait for the first week to finish up in the future) if you like.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg