starting today. Just need the stuff your character is doing for that month. If you are really busy, you can skip Descending Air and come back for Ascending Water.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-09T08:22:45-08:00","id":1014778,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1014726#post1014726\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> We are posting Descending Air letters starting today. Just need the stuff your character is doing for that month. If you are really busy, you can skip Descending Air and come back for Ascending Water.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Alright,<br /> <br /> 1. Dispatch Super Spy demon on two missions:<br /> A.) Investigate/SPY on the killings of magistrates mentioned by Guancyto and<br /> B.) Investigate/SPY on the assassins/gang hired for the hit on Roseblack mentioned by Eura.<br /> <br /> 2. Utilize the information sent by Exthalion to further build contacts - Join the event I was invited to by my contact and socialize there and get in touch with the different contacts provided. Try to bump contacts from 1 to 2. <br /> 3. Request information on this preservation technique so Volivat can try again to manoeuvre his ally into a dragonlord spot by having Darino reveal &quot;his&quot; preservation technique proposal to the general.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4567,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat","user":"Volivat","date":". 12-09-2016, 11:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat","name":"Volivat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-09T08:53:54-08:00","id":1014791,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Volivat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1014778#post1014778\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Alright,<br /> <br /> 1. Dispatch Super Spy demon on two missions:<br /> A.) Investigate/SPY on the killings of magistrates mentioned by Guancyto and</div> </div> </div> </div>I have some information about this one, but I need to know more about your demon to frame the information he finds. How does he spy on people? Why does he spy on people? <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Volivat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1014778#post1014778\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">B.) Investigate/SPY on the assassins/gang hired for the hit on Roseblack mentioned by Eura.</div> </div> </div> </div>OOC information: This is going to go nowhere due to Eura's character's actions. (I'll send you a brief summary of what your demon sees via PM) You can do something else instead. I suggest checking out the House of Bells and see if your demon could find out more about who gave the Roseblack orders. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Volivat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1014778#post1014778\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2. Utilize the information sent by Exthalion to further build contacts</div> </div> </div> </div>In what way would you like to utilize the information? How are you going to approach the contacts mentioned by Akashan?<br /> <br /> Also, were you still planning on attending that luncheon seminar you were invited to by Kebok Taite, your new Ledaal contact? Perhaps you could meet some of the contacts Akashan listed there?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Volivat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1014778#post1014778\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">3. Request information on this preservation technique so Volivat can try again to manoeuvre his ally into a dragonlord spot by having Darino reveal &quot;his&quot; preservation technique proposal to the general.</div> </div> </div> </div>You are going to have to ask Exthalion's character for this information. If Exthalion is agreeable to this, he can say he sent a letter with the details.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-09T18:41:15-08:00","id":1015076,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1014791#post1014791\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You are going to have to ask Exthalion's character for this information. If Exthalion is agreeable to this, he can say he sent a letter with the details.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am fine with that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-09T21:58:51-08:00","id":1015158,"title":"","content":"(giggles madly)<br /> <br /> Elders, elders everywhere!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-10T08:21:58-08:00","id":1015255,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1014791#post1014791\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I have some information about this one, but I need to know more about your demon to frame the information he finds. How does he spy on people? Why does he spy on people?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> OOC information: This is going to go nowhere due to Eura's character's actions. (I'll send you a brief summary of what your demon sees via PM) You can do something else instead. I suggest checking out the House of Bells and see if your demon could find out more about who gave the Roseblack orders.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> In what way would you like to utilize the information? How are you going to approach the contacts mentioned by Akashan?<br /> <br /> Also, were you still planning on attending that luncheon seminar you were invited to by Kebok Taite, your new Ledaal contact? Perhaps you could meet some of the contacts Akashan listed there?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> You are going to have to ask Exthalion's character for this information. If Exthalion is agreeable to this, he can say he sent a letter with the details.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Naburo - Stealer of Knowledge<br /> <br /> Naburo looks like a stereotypical non-friendly well groomed human bureaucrat that is neither tall nor short, yet a bit fat. Wherever he is present, whether dematerialized or materialized others in his presence can smell a faint burning smell as if there was a big fire far away that the wind had brought a waft of. What he desires more than anything else is to steal the knowledge of others and amass it for himself, being happy to share with others as long as they direct him to new targets with secrets or knowledge.<br /> <br /> It can take the form of wind and behave like the force of nature wind is.<br /> <br /> He can, when touching others in his natural form or wind form, sense if they have knowledge or secrets.<br /> He can also befuddle others minds so they reveal knowledge or secrets in some form of way. (muttering to themselves the knowledge/secret, making a letter/note, informing someone else) - This has the side effect of clouding the targets mind making it harder to remember what they just revealed. <br /> If aware of a knowledge/secret he wants to steal he can sense those that might have information valuable to his search.<br /> <br /> So in general if there are no wards against demons and just against dematerialized beings he just takes the shape of wind and blows lazily through an environment searching for candidates to befuddle. If there are wards against both, he generally spies on others when they are off-duty. So following them to their homes, taverns, meetings outside the protected area and so on. <br /> <br /> <br /> Alright, it will stalk the offices of the House of Bells and investigate there for those responsible for Roseblack`s orders.<br /> <br /> <br /> Whispering Twillight will attend the luncheon and see if any of the mentioned contacts are there. If so, he will try to impress them with his occult knowledge. If none are present, he will likely just work the crowds in hope for a fitting additional contact within the Ledaal house he can impress instead.<br /> <br /> Alright, Exthalion agreed to this. So Ill just write that into my letter, having asked and then received the letter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4567,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat","user":"Volivat","date":". 12-10-2016, 11:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat","name":"Volivat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-10T19:19:55-08:00","id":1015476,"title":"","content":"<u><b>Magistrates</b></u><br /> <br /> Roll Investigation (Difficulty 3) for your demon to see if <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Naburo finds the correct people to <i>encourage</i> conversation to be overheard. The Pahua Basin is a big place. <br /> <br /> <u><b>House of Bells</b></u><br /> <br /> Naburo asks if you have any one in mind for him to focus on at the House of Bells. Roll either War or Bureaucracy (Difficulty 2) to give the demon a bonus to overhearing something about Roseblack.<br /> <br /> <u><b>Scholars Luncheon</b></u><br /> <br /> The topic of the Luncheon is the Influence of Wyld Energies on Languages of Creation. </span>Kebok Taite<span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"> gives a talk on his radical language theory. He believes once the population of the Realm spoke on Language. During the Fair Folk Invasion, the Wyld Energies they brought with them fractured the languages into two (Low Realm and High Realm). Taite's research shows a correlation between level of Wyld energies and linguistic drift. He also supposes this could be the reason why Riverspeak emerged, though he has not gotten any readings from the East. (He has not gotten permission to visit the East.) The luncheon devolves into a lively argument about Taite's theory. As the scholars drink more wine, they bellow their criticisms and theory louder and louder. A good time is had by all. <br /> <br /> There are one of the contacts listed on Akashan's list. One is a godblooded Archivist by the name of Heeding Ink. She has pure white skin like paper. Dark marks fade and appear on her skin. You recognize these as the Old Realm transcription of the conversation occurring around the godblooded woman. (She will be a Contact 2, as one of the Archivist in House Ledaal.) She is in conversation with a tall woman with dark skin and hair. The tall woman flashes you a smile when she sees you glance in their direction. The tall woman motions you over to join the conversation.<br /> <br /> <b>What do you do?</b><br /> <br /> <br /> <u><b>The Preservation Method</b></u><br /> <br /> Have Ledaal Darino roll either Craft or Occult (Difficulty 3) to learn enough about the Preservation method to speak intelligently about it. If he fails, he can roll Socialize(Difficulty 3) to attempt to bullshit his way though the conversation. </span><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-12T15:52:18-08:00","id":1016289,"title":"","content":"Random question for something that might never come up: can the family background give its bonus to the person you got family to be related to. If say, Aisa, acted like Mnemon to Mnemon in a way to invoke pride could she get the +1 die to a social roll, or is this more intimacy territory?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-12T15:57:32-08:00","id":1016294,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1016289#post1016289\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Random question for something that might never come up: can the family background give its bonus to the person you got family to be related to. If say, Aisa, acted like Mnemon to Mnemon in a way to invoke pride could she get the +1 die to a social roll, or is this more intimacy territory?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'm going to say that is more Intimacy territory.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-12T16:39:54-08:00","id":1016310,"title":"","content":"Also I edited Roseblack's aspect tag to be wood, since she's a wood aspect.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-13T17:22:47-08:00","id":1016825,"title":"","content":"Reminder, this is letter writing week for Descending Air. We will start Ascending Water on Friday.<br /> <br /> In an effort to even things out (and because sometimes I am brain dead coming up with my own complications), I am going to post my plans for Ryo and have you come up with horrible ways to derail him. Give you guys a chance to enact revenge for all the stuff I do to your characters. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <u><b>Deliberative</b></u><br /> <br /> Ryo is still going to be working with the Deliberative. I got him supporting a bill proposed by Exthalion with Speed the Wheels. I already rolled the dice so Exthalion could write his letter. Ryo rolls insane successes on his roll, so he will succeed in his goal.<br /> <br /> Possible Complication: Ryo did so well, he may attract attention from another family member who wants him to help with his bill. Ryo is not interested in whatever morally reprehensible bill his second cousin wants him to support.<br /> <br /> <u><b>Ragara Amado - Mentor 2 of 3</b></u><br /> <br /> Ryo wants to reconnect with his old Spiral professor and Father-in-law, Ragara Amado. Ryo invited the Dragonblooded over for dinner in the pretense of visiting the grandchildren. I'm going to switch this to Ryo bring his daughters to the old professor's house (Amado will send a note). Dinner goes well or not so well depending on rolls.<br /> <br /> Possible Complication: Amado offers Ryo an alcoholic beverage. Ryo, who hasn't drank since his Exaltation, takes the glass and sets it aside. He uses Mastery of Small Manners to make this action acceptable. However, Shu is in the room. Shu picks up Ryo's glass, takes a sip, and spits it out. (Most six year olds don't like booze). Instead of shock at her bad manners, Amado ignores Shu's action. Just like Ryo's action. In horror, Ryo realizes that Shu just used the same Solar trick he used. Shu is a precocious Solar Half Caste. (Who will be a thorn in Ryo's side for a few months)<br /> <br /> <br /> <u><b>Nellens Pala - Ally 2 of 2</b></u><br /> <br /> Ryo is going to work on schmoozing with his great Aunt, Nellens Pala. My image of Pala is a Dragonblooded who really doesn't want to be in the Deliberative, yet feels likes she must because of Family Duty. She is eager to get Ryo a seat in the Lower House, which he is not too interested in (yet).<br /> <br /> Possible Complication: I'm kind of drawing a blank here. Any ideas?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 12-13-2016, 08:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-15T10:09:48-08:00","id":1017695,"title":"","content":"Titus spills the beans. <br /> <br /> I'm trying to keep Titus' letters in a different tone than Ryo's. Titus is a more terse individual than Ryo.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-16T12:09:37-08:00","id":1018166,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2144_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2144\" data-vbnamecard=\"2144\">Guancyto</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4567\" data-vbnamecard=\"4567\">Volivat</a>, do you need more time for Descending Air?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-16T20:33:21-08:00","id":1018314,"title":"","content":"A little bit, sorry! I'll have something up by Sunday.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto","name":"Guancyto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"699"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-18T14:09:57-08:00","id":1018895,"title":"","content":"I hate to do this to you guys, but I won't have the next Ryo letter ready before I travel for the Holidays this Friday. I'm going to put the game on Hiatus until Jan 6th. This will give Guancyto and Volivat some more time to get their letters up. Feel free to send me anything you have for Ascending Water. I will not be able to respond to it until I get back home.<br /> <br /> This is what I get for starting a game around the Holidays. :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-30T14:26:25-08:00","id":1024498,"title":"","content":"Happy holidays, all!<br /> <br /> I must admit I'm super excited to see this start up again. Looking forward to the next Ryu post, and only slightly sorry for giving everyone else hope by bumping this thread uselessly. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-01T14:33:20-08:00","id":1025169,"title":"","content":"I am back. I'll try to get the next Ryo Letter sometime this week. I'll update the schedule and the website tomorrow. <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2144_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2144\" data-vbnamecard=\"2144\">Guancyto</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4567\" data-vbnamecard=\"4567\">Volivat</a> are you still planning on writing a Descending Air letter?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-02T04:34:40-08:00","id":1025366,"title":"","content":"I am indeed. Got a couple of days off coming up, it's on the list!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto","name":"Guancyto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"699"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-02T13:47:45-08:00","id":1025552,"title":"","content":"So when do we start working on ascending water anyway?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-02T17:36:00-08:00","id":1025640,"title":"","content":"I'll have Ryo's letter up by the 6th, if not sooner. I got to work on my quest first and ride herd on Geico about my car. (I got into a car accident over the holidays. No one was hurt, but my car is now broken in another state.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T11:11:25-08:00","id":1026056,"title":"","content":"I was going through and updating my NPCs (finally ^^; ), and noticed that Ai'Zul and Jal'Kaith are combined into one sheet. It makes sense in one way - not to split up minor characters - but in others is a little annoying. Jal'Kaith is a male earth elemental, for example, while Ai'Zul is a female air one.<br /> <br /> Shall I make a new page for one and separate them out, or keep them together and just explain in the description?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T11:20:22-08:00","id":1026061,"title":"","content":"It depends on how different they are. if it's just cosmetics splitting them up might be overkill but splitting them up gives them better room to be different as well.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T11:32:27-08:00","id":1026073,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BlueWinds</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1026056#post1026056\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was going through and updating my NPCs (finally ^^; ), and noticed that Ai'Zul and Jal'Kaith are combined into one sheet. It makes sense in one way - not to split up minor characters - but in others is a little annoying. Jal'Kaith is a male earth elemental, for example, while Ai'Zul is a female air one.<br /> <br /> Shall I make a new page for one and separate them out, or keep them together and just explain in the description?</div> </div> </div> </div>If you want to make a new page for each elemental, that is fine. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T16:35:05-08:00","id":1026213,"title":"","content":"I updated the Website with the Descending Air posts.<br /> <br /> Here is the schedule for the next six seasons. The schedule may be adjusted based on my work load (I realize that the weak point in this game is my own time.)<br /> <br /> RY 767 Ascending Water (Week 1 - Planning) - 1/6/2017 to 1/12/2017<br /> RY 767 Ascending Water (Week 2 - Letter Writing) - 1/13/2017 to 1/19/2017<br /> <br /> RY 767 Resplendent Water (Week 1 - Planning) - 1/20/2017 to 1/26/2017<br /> RY 767 Resplendent Water (Week 2 - Letter Writing) - 1/27/2017 to 2/2/2017<br /> <br /> RY 767 Descending Water (Week 1 - Planning) - 2/3/2017 to 2/9/2017<br /> RY 767 Descending Water (Week 2 - Letter Writing) - 2/10/2017 to 2/16/2017<br /> <br /> RY 767 Ascending Wood (Week 1 - Planning) - 2/17/2017 to 2/23/2017<br /> RY 767 Ascending Wood (Week 2 - Letter Writing) - 2/24/2017 to 3/2/2017<br /> <br /> RY 767 Resplendent Wood (Week 1 - Planning) - 3/3/2017 to 3/9/2017<br /> RY 767 Resplendent Wood (Week 2 - Letter Writing) - 3/10/2017 to 3/16/2017<br /> <br /> RY 767 Descending Wood (Week 1 - Planning) - 3/17/2017 to 3/23/2017<br /> RY 767 Descending Wood (Week 2 - Letter Writing) - 3/24/2017 to 3/30/2017<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 01-03-2017, 07:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T10:32:37-08:00","id":1027747,"title":"","content":"And Ascending Water has started!<br /> <br /> Some of you have already sent me some stuff, so I will reply to it tonight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T15:23:03-08:00","id":1027869,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2144_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2144\" data-vbnamecard=\"2144\">Guancyto</a> I need a name for your mercenary company. Or else I may just call them the Drunken Bastards.<br /> <br /> I'm working on updating the XP spreadsheet. Just need to verify a few backgrounds with some players.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 01-06-2017, 06:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T22:28:26-08:00","id":1028041,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1027869#post1027869\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2144_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2144\" data-vbnamecard=\"2144\">Guancyto</a> I need a name for your mercenary company. Or else I may just call them the Drunken Bastards.</div> </div> </div> </div>And lo did they become the Drunken Bastards. Eat that, Red Piss Legion!<br /> <br /> (They probably have a more proper name but, like the Red Piss Legion, nobody can remember it.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto","user":"Guancyto","date":". 01-07-2017, 01:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto","name":"Guancyto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"699"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-11T13:54:58-08:00","id":1030233,"title":"","content":"FYI. Letter writing starts tomorrow. Please get your planning information in to me ASAP. Or let me know if you are skipping this next letter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-11T16:49:39-08:00","id":1030316,"title":"","content":"I forget, did I send you my thing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-11T16:52:08-08:00","id":1030318,"title":"","content":"Not yet. The last thing I have from you is the name of the Dragon King contact. I figured you were busy with school.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-14T23:15:16-08:00","id":1032002,"title":"","content":"(grins) I stole one the ST's NPCs~<br /> <br /> I also wanted to note an intentional discrepancy - the loan Aisa made was for 4 bars, while she asked Camila for a full talent. She lied about the amount in her letter, and now she's now sitting on a big chunk of cash. IC Aisa feels she has perfectly good reasons (in case further emergencies come up), but OOC I got an OK from Guan before doing that, because it's not the nicest thing in the world. ^^;;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-15T04:28:00-08:00","id":1032079,"title":"","content":"My specific reaction was: &quot;Frankly, if Aisa doesn't win the throne atop a pile of shattered corpses, and if none of those include her allies, I will be a little disappointed. =P&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto","name":"Guancyto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"699"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T11:11:10-08:00","id":1033478,"title":"","content":"FYI, Titus won't be sending a letter this month. I've been working 11 hour days and I wasn't really planning on having Titus writing a letter each month. I figured after the bombshells he dropped in the past two letters, Titus would be keeping his head down this month. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> Titus did write a few of the PCs in response to information requests. Those letters simply contained the requested information.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T18:05:17-08:00","id":1033772,"title":"","content":"Darn, I could've said something crazy about Titus and he couldn't have corrected me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-19T08:36:55-08:00","id":1034625,"title":"","content":"So, while I know IC, many of the conspiracy members want to avoid all out war, but I want to feel out what people want OOC. Do we want the Blessed Isle to break out into war? <br /> <br /> I like the idea of Conspiracy members being on separate sides of the conflict and scheming together bring about their desired outcome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-19T10:22:38-08:00","id":1034694,"title":"","content":"I like the idea of open conflict at some point - and an actual war will force Aisa to compromise, and compromise, and compromise until finally she's forced to wonder what she's even fighting for. And if she does end up becoming empress, it's atop a pile of shattered corpses and broken ideals.<br /> <br /> Imagining the flow of the game, I think of half a year of buildup / everyone getting established, then Aisa having an open break with Mnemon. Half a year of growing tension, then at the end of the first year, Aisa openly announcing herself at Empress - which naturally results in immediate civil war. Half a year of war, then a resolution of some sort. Half a year of dealing with the new regime, then we're at the two year mark of your original proposal. Obviously things shouldn't be so tidy, but that's my mental roadmap.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-19T10:33:25-08:00","id":1034701,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BlueWinds</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1034694#post1034694\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like the idea of open conflict at some point - and an actual war will force Aisa to compromise, and compromise, and compromise until finally she's forced to wonder what she's even fighting for. And if she does end up becoming empress, it's atop a pile of shattered corpses and broken ideals.<br /> <br /> Imagining the flow of the game, I think of half a year of buildup / everyone getting established, then Aisa having an open break with Mnemon. Half a year of growing tension, then at the end of the first year, Aisa openly announcing herself at Empress - which naturally results in immediate civil war. Half a year of war, then a resolution of some sort. Half a year of dealing with the new regime, then we're at the two year mark of your original proposal. Obviously things shouldn't be so tidy, but that's my mental roadmap.</div> </div> </div> </div>My original plan is to let people build up for 6 -8 months. Then have some NPCs do their things. Things may get uncomfortable for a few characters. Ideally, I'd like conspiracy members to be on various sides of the upcoming conflict, so PCs may have to do things they don't like and maybe betray some of the NPCs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T06:57:55-08:00","id":1035196,"title":"","content":"I should have Ryo's next letter up by Sunday afternoon, because &quot;OMG, they are inviting extra people to my 10:30 meeting, so I may have to work late again.&quot; <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-22T15:46:52-08:00","id":1036314,"title":"","content":"I posted Ryo's Resplendent Water letter. Feel free to start sending me your events for Resplendent water. I'm working on XP now.<br /> <br /> I am going to try to scale back the rolls on your complications. I think I got into table top ST mode. I ended up running scenes instead of just letting you write your letter. You guys are getting good at coming up with your own trouble. Less rolls means less messages and less delays and more writing time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-24T11:46:10-08:00","i