tus' letters. I will also update and give more details on what the various NPCs are doing in your specific area. Also need to update the schedule.<br /> <br /> I'll try to get this all done by tomorrow.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-27-2017, 11:36 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-28T09:09:18-08:00","id":1056140,"title":"","content":"For my sanity's sake, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3103_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3103\" data-vbnamecard=\"3103\">Eura</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1144_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1144\" data-vbnamecard=\"1144\">Exthalion</a>, can you tell me what Backgrounds and XP expenditures you made for Descending Water?<br /> <br /> Everyone else's <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1ZCFTahn26VdjhdpHZ69kyAkG2yRiEYAt67-5GDmSP10/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">XP</a> has been updated.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/c