a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Allies: Roseblack 5 of 5<br /> Allies: Darkest Dawn: 1 of ??</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I've been making Celestial Exalts three points.<br /> <br /> Spreadsheet has been updated. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-28T11:06:54-08:00","id":1056221,"title":"","content":"I had been meaning to post a 'secondary letter' to hold content that didn't fit in the main one, so here we go. Events are moving fast, so time for us to move faster. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Aisa intends to have a gathering of house leaders at her birthday part the likes of which hasn't been seen since the Empress disappeared.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-28T12:16:55-08:00","id":1056265,"title":"","content":"I'm glad you posted that second letter because I was under the impression Tepet only had Amber river.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-28T13:40:28-08:00","id":1056303,"title":"","content":"I'm not entirely clear myself! wonderandawe, can you clear up what exactly Aisa negotiated exchanging hands?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-28T13:53:57-08:00","id":1056312,"title":"","content":"I believe just Amber River. It's been a while since I read the North Book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-28T15:53:36-08:00","id":1056353,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1056312#post1056312\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I believe just Amber River. It's been a while since I read the North Book.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is Amber River synonymous with &quot;The Slave Coast&quot;? That was Aisa's aim - to free the set of satrapies defined by their drug/slave combination. It's fine if she had to settle, but just want to be clear on what's what.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-28T16:06:12-08:00","id":1056361,"title":"","content":"Amber River is the part of the Slave coast Roseblack and I were invading. A single legion isn't big enough to attack an entire direction's coast at once. I'll likely have to wait a long time to attack the other satrapies if your diplomacy shenanigans didn't work as intended.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-28T17:12:37-08:00","id":1056380,"title":"","content":"It was a one for one deal. The other satrapies are run by other houses I believe? <br /> <br /> Can't let Aisa steal all of Quelaana's plot. Lol","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-28T18:47:07-08:00","id":1056413,"title":"","content":"In which Ryo acts like a Solar and rages at injustice. I was drinking Cider when I wrote Ryo's letter, so I hope it doesn't sound funny. :P <br /> <br /> I'll post the OOC stuff tomorrow.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-28T22:19:32-08:00","id":1056489,"title":"","content":"Ryu's letter will get a quick Wind Carried Words response - &quot;Mnemon's offer is unacceptable, yes. What I need is an alternative Cynis will find attractive. Drugs and slaves are not their sole interest, reputation aside.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-01T09:46:18-08:00","id":1056666,"title":"","content":"OOC Stuff<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3103_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3103\" data-vbnamecard=\"3103\">Eura</a> <br /> <br /> Gold Faction is well at work. The Blood Hand wants to burn the Opium Stockpile. Cynis says it is their property and wants to take it with them when they leave. Cynis wants to charge Tepet for &quot;weaning&quot; the population off the drugs. Having a whole population go Cold Turkey will lead to more unrest. Also, there is still opium being sold on the streets. <br /> <br /> Uncle Helkar has been captured by the Mnemon Fleet. His ships have been commandeered by Mnemon and he and his officers are bound and gagged. The plan behind this is to have an OOC ace in the whole when the Conspiracy deals with the Mnemon Fleet. Helkar is your ally, so he will effect an dramatically appropriate escape. <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1144_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1144\" data-vbnamecard=\"1144\">Exthalion</a> <br /> <br /> Bronze Faction is getting all up in your business.<br /> <br /> Ledaal Kes has overwhelmed crafting requests to your workshop. He assumes you are on board with his little &quot;Save the Realm&quot; plan. A representative from the Bronze Faction has approached you to offer assistance to acquire a Factory Cathedral. This is the secret Sidereal Factory Cathedral on the Blessed Isle, not the broken unused one Peleps Hiro is sitting on. Using this Factory Cathedral will indebt Akashan to the Bronze Faction. <br /> <br /> <br /> I will get to BlueWinds and Guancyto this afternoon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-01T14:13:14-08:00","id":1056795,"title":"","content":"OOC Stuff Part 2<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2144_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2144\" data-vbnamecard=\"2144\">Guancyto</a> <br /> <br /> Your legion is getting antsy babysitting refugees. A brawl breaks out in a makeshift tavern which starts a fire that takes out a third of the refugee camp. As commander of the Legion, the Magistrate expect you to keep discipline. <br /> <br /> I have a question. Would you bring Reaches the Sky with you to meet the Central God of War?<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar9510_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"9510\" data-vbnamecard=\"9510\">BlueWinds</a> <br /> <br /> Your grandmother wants to know why Cynis still has a presence in the North.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-01T14:24:12-08:00","id":1056800,"title":"","content":"This is how letter planning is going to go.<br /> <br /> 1. I will post Ryo (and maybe Titus) letters.<br /> 2. I post OOC updates on your situation and maybe send you new plot. (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-%E2%80%93-an-epistolary-game?p=1056666#post1056666\">See</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-%E2%80%93-an-epistolary-game?p=1056795#post1056795\">above</a>)<br /> 3. Via PM, you will send me your actions and complications. You will have three backgrounds and two crafting slots (if you are a crafter)<br /> 4. I will approve complications and send you dice rolls and difficulties.<br /> 5. You roll dice and send results via PM<br /> 6. You write letters. Be sure to include your backgrounds/crafting slots/xp spends in a spoiler tag at the bottom of the letter.<br /> <br /> The basic idea is to decrease the back and forth needed to write letters and to front load my involvement in the letters. That way I can better schedule my time for the game instead of juggling everyone's replies over a period of two weeks. <br /> <br /> This work for everyone?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-01-2017, 05:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-01T16:04:51-08:00","id":1056828,"title":"","content":"Sounds good to me.<br /> <br /> It looks like no Titus letter this m