ing NPCs next. <br /> <br /> Also, I forgot! I'm giving you all 2 bonus XP for being so proactive in the Season of Water. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-03T19:49:18-08:00","id":1057895,"title":"","content":"I just found a WAY better picture of Ryo than the one I had before.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://db4sgowjqfwig.cloudfront.net/images/3968296/Ryo2.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Except Ryo would be wearing Red (I assume everyone in the Thousand Scales wears Scarlet) and would clip his nails.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-03-2017, 10:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-04T09:45:24-08:00","id":1058068,"title":"","content":"Like so? Ten characters.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/l4HXmNA.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\"