link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-05T08:19:04-08:00","id":1058415,"title":"","content":"Oh, I meant to ask - does anyone up north have time to cultivate the Cynis alliance Aisa set the stage for? She's super busy and doesn't have much time to spare, but one of you closer to the action would be an ideal candidate. Cynis Belar, one of the leaders of the house and a sorceress, is Aisa's current point of contact, and she'd be happy to make introductions (overt or subtle) if someone else wants to start taking her as an Ally.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-05T11:34:56-08:00","id":1058498,"title":"","content":"My current letter has Cynis getting involved in a venture that promises to make the Realm in a major food exporter, and I was going to break Mnemnon's blockade using a sorcerous research trip as a cover. Does that help?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-05T12:45:45-08:00","id":1058524,"title":"","content":"Most of the players are done with planning so we should be ready to start letter writing next week. <br /> <br /> Still haven't heard from Guancyto.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-06T23:05:25-08:00","id":1059361,"title":"","content":"Sorry, I seem to have persistently missed the &quot;this is how it's going to work in future&quot; post and was pretty puzzled... well, how things were going to work.<br /> <br /> Good now, I'll start sending you stuff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto","name":"Guancyto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"699"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-07T10:02:55-08:00","id":1059588,"title":"","content":"A couple of final question before I get started:<br /> <br /> What sort of access do I have to Exotic Material Components? Artifacts have a listed resource cost for production, which I can cover for most of my needs, Are EMCs just another resource purchase? Do my various trade partners have a system in place for it yet?<br /> <br /> Can I assume that library I &quot;found&quot; has access to anything I can think of? I have some fairly low-level plans right now but once the above question is sorted out I plan to go a little crazy.<br /> <br /> Do the people I took out that loan from care if I take some time for personal projects? Also not an issue right this moment since what I would be using it on was already worked out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-07T10:16:42-08:00","id":1059593,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1059588#post1059588\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A couple of final question before I get started:<br /> <br /> What sort of access do I have to Exotic Material Components? Artifacts have a listed resource cost for production, which I can cover for most of my needs, Are EMCs just another resource purchase? Do my various trade partners have a system in place for it yet?</div> </div> </div> </div>You have access to the exotic materials to make your two crafting slots. IC, your character will be sending out expeditions to acquire these materials. I should note crafting slots work like the Background slots. If you want to make a five dot artifact, you will need to spend five months making it. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1059588#post1059588\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Can I assume that library I &quot;found&quot; has access to anything I can think of? I have some fairly low-level plans right now but once the above question is sorted out I plan to go a little crazy.</div> </div> </div> </div>You have access to most plans, except for the limits the Bronze faction impose on you. You can break those limits, but you have to convince Titus (or rather, the Storyteller) to do so. OOC, I don't want any crazy weapon/transportation artifacts until sometime after next calibration. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1059588#post1059588\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do the people I took out that loan from care if I take some time for personal projects? Also not an issue right this moment since what I would be using it on was already worked out.</div> </div> </div> </div>Remind me who you took the loan out from again.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-07T10:41:10-08:00","id":1059606,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1059593#post1059593\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You have access to the exotic materials to make your two crafting slots. IC, your character will be sending out expeditions to acquire these materials. I should note crafting slots work like the Background slots. If you want to make a five dot artifact, you will need to spend five months making it.</div> </div> </div> </div>A: What happens if I could technically craft it faster? The factory cathedral reduces the interval from 1 season to 1 month. My hearthstone halves that to 2 weeks. Once I get that custom charm it will halve it again to 1 week when I am working alone, faster with help. Having complete plans halves the number of required successes.<br /> <br /> B: Factory-Cathedrals can make artifacts in batches. It still takes EMCs, which could mean dozens are required to make a full batch of low level artifacts.<br /> <br /> Would we fluff gathering the EMCs as what takes the X weeks even if I could craft faster? For big artifacts it might roughly work out. For smaller I could have them done in a single roll.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1059593#post1059593\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You have access to most plans, except for the limits the Bronze faction impose on you. You can break those limits, but you have to convince Titus (or rather, the Storyteller) to do so. OOC, I don't want any crazy weapon/transportation artifacts until sometime after next calibration.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was more interest in if there exist Design Beyond Limit / Art of Permanence / Both version of things I might want that use Exotic Material Components I can acquire. Even if not, just knowing X is possible could be a guide for making functional equivalents but without the benefits of the Solar charms I can't replicate. (Unless Ryo is up for a long break as my apprentice <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1059593#post1059593\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Remind me who you took the loan out from again.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Bronze Faction. I wanted to know if I could use the factory cathedral for personal projects.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 03-07-2017, 01:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-07T11:33:10-08:00","id":1059633,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1059606#post1059606\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A: What happens if I could technically craft it faster? The factory cathedral reduces the interval from 1 season to 1 month. My hearthstone halves that to 2 weeks. Once I get that custom charm it will halve it again to 1 week when I am working alone, faster with help. Having complete plans halves the number of required successes.<br /> <br /> B: Factory-Cathedrals can make artifacts in batches. It still takes EMCs, which could mean dozens are required to make a full batch of low level artifacts.<br /> <br /> Would we fluff gathering the EMCs as what takes the X weeks even if I could craft faster? For big artifacts it might roughly work out. For smaller I could have them done in a single roll.</div> </div> </div> </div>For purposes of this game format, I was going to give you additional crafting slots instead of crafting speed. For example, a FC will give you 3x the crafting slots (6 slots). So it still take you five months to build a five dot artifact, but you can build lots of them at the same time. Akashan can arm out a Legion rather in the time it would take a normal crafter to make one set of armor.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1059606#post1059606\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I was more interest in if there exist Design Beyond Limit / Art of Permanence / Both version of things I might want that use Exotic Material Components I can acquire. Even if not, just knowing X is possible could be a guide for making functional equivalents but without the benefits of the Solar charms I can't replicate. (Unless Ryo is up for a long break as my apprentice <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />)</div> </div> </div> </div>Are there artifacts in the game book that replicate those charms?<br /> <br /> Ryo will not become your golden crafting monkey. He is too busy reorganizing the government so it runs more efficiently. :P<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1059606#post1059606\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Bronze Faction. I wanted to know if I could use the factory cathedral for personal projects.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, the use of the word loan made me think of the money Carmela loaned Aisa.<br /> <br /> According to the terms the Bronze Faction has laid out, you can only use the FC for preparing Creation for the upcoming underworld invasion. Now, that doesn't mean you can't use the FC for personal projects anyways. You will have to roll Larceny to make sure you don't get caught. Maybe Socialize if you do get caught to talk your way out of trouble. What fun is it to play a member of a conspiracy if you don't misuse the resources of others to further the conspiracy's goals?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-07T12:25:28-08:00","id":1059665,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1059633#post1059633\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What fun is it to play a member of a conspiracy if you don't misuse the resources of others to further the conspiracy's goals?</div> </div> </div> </div>(whistles innocently) Why in the world would one want to do that?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-07T14:18:16-08:00","id":1059743,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1059633#post1059633\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For purposes of this game format, I was going to give you additional crafting slots instead of crafting speed. For example, a FC will give you 3x the crafting slots (6 slots). So it still take you five months to build a five dot artifact, but you can build lots of them at the same time. Akashan can arm out a Legion rather in the time it would take a normal crafter to make one set of armor.</div> </div> </div> </div>So: I have 2<br /> Hearthstone (doubles speed) makes that 4.<br /> FC x3 Makes it 12? And makes artifacts in batches?<br /> <br /> Effectively: Each speed multiplier become a multiplier to the number craft slots? And it is assumed I have EMCs to fill all of them?<br /> <br /> Sorry, just want to be sure I am parsing properly.<br /> <br /> <br /> Edit: Would Ryo be adverse to trying to get a defense spending bill through the Deliberative to pay for all the <s>yellow cake uran</s> I mean EMCs to pay for all this? Ledaal can probably cover it right now, but it would look an awful lot like an arms buildup for the impending civil war.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1059633#post1059633\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are there artifacts in the game book that replicate those charms?<br /> <br /> Ryo will not become your golden crafting monkey. He is too busy reorganizing the government so it runs more efficiently. :P</div> </div> </div> </div>There are not.<br /> DBL is Craft 5, E4. For Artifacts it lets you craft an artifact as though it were 1 dot lower without changing its actual power. So you could craft a Daiklave (Artifact 2) with 10 successes and only 1 Exotic Material Component. When used with Manses it lets you cap a demesne with a manse one dot higher or to cap a 5 dot demesne with a manse that has twice the normal creation points.<br /> <br /> AoP is Craft 6 E6. It raises the Resource or Artifact level of an item by one but removes all need for maintenance and it lasts forever. So a candle would never run down, a sword would never need sharpening, an implosion bow with AoP alchemical reagents would never need to be refilled, etc.<br /> <br /> <br /> Ryo has young, impressionable (halfcaste) children of an age to be sent away for apprenticeship doesn't he?,,,<br /> (If he wan'ts to make it up to me, he can exact petty revenge on his wife's old boyfriend so we can buy up that manse at the bankruptcy sale.)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1059633#post1059633\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah, the use of the word loan made me think of the money Carmela loaned Aisa.<br /> <br /> According to the terms the Bronze Faction has laid out, you can only use the FC for preparing Creation for the upcoming underworld invasion. Now, that doesn't mean you can't use the FC for personal projects anyways. You will have to roll Larceny to make sure you don't get caught. Maybe Socialize if you do get caught to talk your way out of trouble. What fun is it to play a member of a conspiracy if you don't misuse the resources of others to further the conspiracy's goals?</div> </div> </div> </div>Is it really misuse if its for their own good? Silly Sidereals, &quot;preparing Creation for the upcoming underworld invasion&quot; is so vague I could use it for almost anything.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-07T14:30:05-08:00","id":1059754,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1059743#post1059743\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So: I have 2<br /> Hearthstone (doubles speed) makes that 4.<br /> FC x3 Makes it 12? And makes artifacts in batches?<br /> <br /> Effectively: Each speed multiplier become a multiplier to the number craft slots? And it is assumed I have EMCs to fill all of them?<br /> <br /> Sorry, just want to be sure I am parsing properly.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. With your Hearthstone and the Bronze Faction FC you will have 12 slots. (This may be a lot, but Carmela has a legion to arm and you have a fleet to arm.)<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1059743#post1059743\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Edit: Would Ryo be adverse to trying to get a defense spending bill through the Deliberative to pay for all the <s>yellow cake uran</s> I mean EMCs to pay for all this? Ledaal can probably cover it right now, but it would look an awful lot like an arms buildup for the impending civil war.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ryo says that will open up a can of worms. Everyone will be adding pork to a bill like that. He suggests trying to drain the Ledaal treasury first.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1059743#post1059743\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Ryo has young, impressionable (halfcaste) children of an age to be sent away for apprenticeship doesn't he?,,,<br /> (If he wan'ts to make it up to me, he can exact petty revenge on his wife's old boyfriend so we can buy up that manse at the bankruptcy sale.)</div> </div> </div> </div>He has one half caste child who is six. Way too young to be sent off to the Dragonblooded Jadeworks in his opinion. And after he gets Aisa's letter, Shu isn't going to be let out of his sight until well... most likely never.<br /> <br /> ((I gave Zara to Aisa in an attempt to scatter Ryo connected NPCs to each player. You got Ryo, Aisa got Zara, Carmela got Saveria, Ryo's wife, Quelaana didn't get anyone, though I have some vague plans of shipping Shu North for her own safety. ))<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1059743#post1059743\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is it really misuse if its for their own good? Silly Sidereals, &quot;preparing Creation for the upcoming underworld invasion&quot; is so vague I could use it for almost anything.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm sure the Sidereals worded it better than your poor ST posting at Subway. Of course they have the ace in the hole of &quot;If you are really doing this for the upcoming invasion, you don't mind if we take the artifact and use it to prepare say... House Mnemon.... Can't leave any of the other Dynasts houses defenseless.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-07-2017, 05:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-07T16:25:13-08:00","id":1059814,"title":"","content":"Can I find Solar Charm enhanced plans for artifacts? Also, the initial buildup in the next few months looks like it might bankrupt Ledaal. Dozens of Resources 5 purchases, not including EMCs.<br /> <br /> Also, custom artifact question:<br /> <br /> In Oadenol's Codex the Landship is Artifact 2. However, its description states that combined with a Folding Boat (Artifact 4) would make an Artifact 5. Can I bump up the rating of a different artifact 4 ship by 1 to reflect a landship keel? I was thinking specifically of a Swift-Midday Brilliance class light warship.<br /> <br /> I am going to assume that the DBL plans for that probably don't exist, since the First Age had skyships, (Though it would be nice if they did)<br /> <br /> <br /> Edit: Would there happen to be river access from the secret FC to the Sea? I <i>could</i> just craft some 500 windslave disks and have people literally carry the ships, that that lacks some finesse. (And if it didn't take 1500 motes could be used to make very low flying skyships)<br /> <br /> Edit 2: Could I substitute a Warbird for one of the &quot;Common Warstrider curled in a fetal position&quot; in the cargo of the Swift-Midday? I would ask for two of them, but I assume the listed cargo has to include food and repair supplies for any voyage of reasonable length.<br /> <br /> (The Silver Prince can exhume his heart out when my fully armed and operation fleet + airwing is ready)<br /> <br /> Edit 3: It is remarkable how small First Age ships are. The N/A battlecruiser is only half again as long as a trireme and even the coast guard has ships almost 3 times as long.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 03-07-2017, 07:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-07T17:28:50-08:00","id":1059837,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1059814#post1059814\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can I find Solar Charm enhanced plans for artifacts? Also, the initial buildup in the next few months looks like it might bankrupt Ledaal. Dozens of Resources 5 purchases, not including EMCs.<br /> <br /> Also, custom artifact question:<br /> <br /> In Oadenol's Codex the Landship is Artifact 2. However, its description states that combined with a Folding Boat (Artifact 4) would make an Artifact 5. Can I bump up the rating of a different artifact 4 ship by 1 to reflect a landship keel? I was thinking specifically of a Swift-Midday Brilliance class light warship.<br /> <br /> I am going to assume that the DBL plans for that probably don't exist, since the First Age had skyships, (Though it would be nice if they did)<br /> <br /> <br /> Edit: Would there happen to be river access from the secret FC to the Sea? I <i>could</i> just craft some 500 windslave disks and have people literally carry the ships, that that lacks some finesse. (And if it didn't take 1500 motes could be used to make very low flying skyships)<br /> <br /> Edit 2: Could I substitute a Warbird for one of the &quot;Common Warstrider curled in a fetal position&quot; in the cargo of the Swift-Midday? I would ask for two of them, but I assume the listed cargo has to include food and repair supplies for any voyage of reasonable length.<br /> <br /> (The Silver Prince can exhume his heart out when my fully armed and operation fleet + airwing is ready)<br /> <br /> Edit 3: It is remarkable how small First Age ships are. The N/A battlecruiser is only half again as long as a trireme and even the coast guard has ships almost 3 times as long.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll let Akashan figure out how he is going to fund/acquire materials for all these projects of his. Jade, as a magical material, is something you have access to, as they mine it at the Imperial Mountain. The Bronze Faction Sidereals have given you the locations of some Magical Materials, but Akashan has to sent out expeditions to retrieve them. Ryo could help push a bill though the Deliberative, but Akashan will have to write and sponsor it. After being caught screwing with the Cynis legions, Ryo's trying to keep a low profile.<br /> <br /> You aren't going to be given access to First Age vehicle plans. The Bronze Faction will not give you those plans. They fall under both weapons and transportation. Titus probably won't be able to sneak you any because if you use them, the Bronze Faction will know where they came from. Building warships is not something you can easily hide.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-07-2017, 08:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-07T18:08:40-08:00","id":1059854,"title":"","content":"To be honest, I'm just trying to pace things until next Calibration. That is when I kick the table and let everything go crazy. All the brakes are off. The Jade Prison is opened. Cats will live with Dogs. Sidereals waving their hands in the air, going nuts. Solariods will be running all over Creation, screwing shit up. It should be good times. Titus will probably give you a whole bunch of First Age plans at that point. (If you remember who Titus is. There is a chance he would have exalted by that point. )<br /> <br /> But, we still got half a year to go before we get to that point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-07-2017, 09:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-07T19:21:15-08:00","id":1059883,"title":"","content":"Well, if my lovely new DK contact will agree to work more or less like a slave using a Step I am almost certain she has for a few weeks I could cover all my EMC costs. Having more DK would help this immensely.<br /> <br /> It isn't a huge deal right this month because half of an Artifact's successes are from planning so I am not spending much money yet.Next month though...<br /> <br /> Do Manses take up craft slots?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-08T07:05:15-08:00","id":1060063,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1059883#post1059883\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, if my lovely new DK contact will agree to work more or less like a slave using a Step I am almost certain she has for a few weeks I could cover all my EMC costs. Having more DK would help this immensely.<br /> <br /> It isn't a huge deal right this month because half of an Artifact's successes are from planning so I am not spending much money yet.Next month though...<br /> <br /> Do Manses take up craft slots?</div> </div> </div> </div>We have a few months to figure out the supply issue. You may be able to open a trade route from Rathess. You have boats to build. Kes is sending you a bunch of crafting requests, which he does supply mats for. (Soulsteel stuff mostly. He is curious about the properties of the material)<br /> <br /> Manses for other people take up a crafting slot. Manse on your character sheet will be a background slot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-12T12:07:32-07:00","id":1061579,"title":"","content":"A question to the players: Right now I have 12 craft slots. Are there any artifacts you would like me to make for you or recommendations for artifacts that would be useful to the conspiracy?<br /> <br /> I don't want to just churn out 12 Emerald Thuribles or Factory-Cathedrals, since that would cheapen those things, (Well I do, but it would be bad for the game if I did/could) Fullying kitted out artifact ships take something like 8 artifacts with the weapons and all, and I don't want to burden wonderandawe with too many custom creations, especially N/A (Though Putting Noon and Midnight Cauldrons on a skyship and doing 100 damage at 2 miles is also something I want to but shouldn't do.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-12T15:26:30-07:00","id":1061624,"title":"","content":"I suppose a chandellier for the Heptagram dining hall wouldn't go amiss, where the candles burn blue when someone serves poisoned food or drink. Or maybe a black jade Daiklave to present to Zara? Otherwise, :shrug:. Aisa's not the sort to rely on toys, though she can always use expensive and rare gifts. A half dozen jade breastplates could surely be used to secure some deal or other with a great house. Other people probably need things more. The chandellier would help Aisa sleep a bit better, but none of it is very important.<br /> <br /> Eura - I'm sure Aisa knows, but where is Inara? Detailed in a book somewhere, or something created for this game?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-12T15:44:36-07:00","id":1061633,"title":"","content":"So I am back* and I updated the schedule for Water. <br /> <br /> *Why did I schedule a board game night, a knitting guild meeting, and playing in a Trail of Cthulhu game on the same weekend?!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-12T21:09:30-07:00","id":1061721,"title":"","content":"Inara is the only city with a &quot;natural&quot; Soulsteel mine in creation. Most of the places I mention only really show up in the north book. the annoying thing about Inara is that the writers were so busy writing about history and relations they failed to make a single npc for said city so all npc's in that city are custom. It hints at Prince of shadows being there but he hasn't exalted yet so he's still in Varang as an apprentice atm.<br /> <br /> As for artifacts a gill cloak would be nice. I'm good on martial artifacts barring some of the crazier martial arts artifacts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-12T23:07:07-07:00","id":1061734,"title":"","content":"Obviously Carmela needs the Eye of the Fire Dragon, and the Daiklave of Conquest, and a Directional Titan.<br /> <br /> Oh, and the Five-Metal Shrike.<br /> <br /> Because why go halfway when using the crafting rules to break the game over your knee? &gt;:P<br /> <br /> More seriously, the style of this game renders most &quot;I git moar numbers&quot; artifacts entirely cosmetic. So, while I would welcome the opportunity to trade in my Smashfists for a Dire Lance or a Daiklave, it would mostly be for the aesthetics (and possibly the sudden ability to swordfight people who cross me). Something utility-like like a Revelation Blindfold, a Gill Cloak, a banner for my camp that allows me to issue orders and snuff flames while I'm at the bar, a bottle of fresh water that never runs out, or - oh you have a Jadeborn on retainer, don't you? Transformative Armor was always one of my favorites for the versatility in visual design without the nuclear option that is an Infinite Resplendence Amulet.<br /> <br /> Edit: OR I guess I have a legion to arm, so if you wanna do something about that (magic war banners ahoy!) then I'd be appreciative.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto","user":"Guancyto","date":". 03-13-2017, 04:36 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto","name":"Guancyto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"699"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-14T09:01:09-07:00","id":1062319,"title":"","content":"So I've been doing a lot of thinking these past few weeks and even with the new changes to the format, I am going to have to end the game. I got a lot of real life stuff I've been putting off and I need the creative energy to work on that. (I can't let the fiance do everything while I play in fantasy land.)<br /> <br /> I feel really bad about ending the game. I was hoping the letter writing format would cure the curse of play by post games. However, it just moved the weak point of the game from the players to the ST. Like most things, I underestimated the amount of work it would take to run the game. <br /> <br /> I apologize again on bailing on you guys. At least we got further than most play by post games and I hope you guys had as much fun playing as I had running it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-14T09:22:44-07:00","id":1062330,"title":"","content":"Saddening but I'm not surprised. I was starting to see the wear and tear.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-14T09:34:37-07:00","id":1062335,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1062319#post1062319\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I've been doing a lot of thinking these past few weeks and even with the new changes to the format, I am going to have to end the game. I got a lot of real life stuff I've been putting off and I need the creative energy to work on that. (I can't let the fiance do everything while I play in fantasy land.)<br /> <br /> I feel really bad about ending the game. I was hoping the letter writing format would cure the curse of play by post games. However, it just moved the weak point of the game from the players to the ST. Like most things, I underestimated the amount of work it would take to run the game.<br /> <br /> I apologize again on bailing on you guys. At least we got further than most play by post games and I hope you guys had as much fun playing as I had running it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you very much for running this as far as you have. I've had a wonderful time.<br /> <br /> Would you object to someone else taking over as ST, rather than letting this die quarter-finished?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-14T10:07:33-07:00","id":1062357,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BlueWinds</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1062335#post1062335\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Thank you very much for running this as far as you have. I've had a wonderful time.<br /> <br /> Would you object to someone else taking over as ST, rather than letting this die quarter-finished?</div> </div> </div> </div>I have no objections to this. I can send anyone my &quot;evil plans&quot; or the new ST can come up with their own evil plans.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-14T10:42:24-07:00","id":1062368,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1062319#post1062319\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I've been doing a lot of thinking these past few weeks and even with the new changes to the format, I am going to have to end the game. I got a lot of real life stuff I've been putting off and I need the creative energy to work on that. (I can't let the fiance do everything while I play in fantasy land.)<br /> <br /> I feel really bad about ending the game. I was hoping the letter writing format would cure the curse of play by post games. However, it just moved the weak point of the game from the players to the ST. Like most things, I underestimated the amount of work it would take to run the game.<br /> <br /> I apologize again on bailing on you guys. At least we got further than most play by post games and I hope you guys had as much fun playing as I had running it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Please don't feel too bad about it, I greatly enjoyed this game and appreciate all the effort you put into it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1062357#post1062357\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I have no objections to this. I can send anyone my &quot;evil plans&quot; or the new ST can come up with their own evil plans.</div> </div> </div> </div>Remind them to tell me no. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-14T10:52:35-07:00","id":1062377,"title":"","content":"Let me ask a friend or two if they're interested - anyone else have people they'd like to ask? I'd be pretty nervous about just posting a 'wanted' ad on the forums, but I suppose it could work.<br /> <br /> I've enjoyed playing Aisa a ton, but if we don't find someone else I'd be willing to step up as ST.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-14T11:40:22-07:00","id":1062397,"title":"","content":"You could play Aisa as a GM-PC as I did Ryo. Though I did have trouble coming up with complications for him after running stuff for the other players.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-14T11:50:01-07:00","id":1062405,"title":"","content":"We also have Roseblack for a victory condition if Aisa has to be retired aka mnemonized.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-14T12:43:30-07:00","id":1062436,"title":"","content":"We could try some sort of round robin.<br /> <br /> What if each player is the ST for one other player and is responsible for coming up with difficulties and complications for them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-15T12:48:46-07:00","id":1062930,"title":"","content":"Guan is currently reaching out to one of his friends (who's also the one I was going to speak with), who's expressed tentative interest. Will see where that goes.<br /> <br /> The round-robin ST thing is interesting, but I'd prefer not to experiment with it here. Coordination for grand NPC plans and sweeping events seems like it would suffer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-15T16:54:03-07:00","id":1063024,"title":"","content":"I think I'm your new ST!<br /> <br /> Gonna need to give me a while to get up to speed, my work weeks are busy so it might not be till the weekend that I really sit down to read all this. But hi!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1211-fansibubbles","name":"Fansibubbles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1211_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-15T17:05:31-07:00","id":1063031,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fansibubbles</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1063024#post1063024\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think I'm your new ST!<br /> <br /> Gonna need to give me a while to get up to speed, my work weeks are busy so it might not be till the weekend that I really sit down to read all this. But hi!</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll write you some details over the next couple of days.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-17T09:18:34-07:00","id":1063897,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fansibubbles</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998288-ooc-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-\u2013-an-epistolary-game?p=1063024#post1063024\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think I'm your new ST!<br /> <br /> Gonna need to give me a while to get up to speed, my work weeks are busy so it might not be till the weekend that I really sit down to read all this. But hi!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I wrote up five pages of plot for you. Did you want me to send it via PM or link you a google document.<br /> <br /> Also, we will need to transition the OP site to you.<br /> <br /> Also, would you like a copy of all the PM conversations between me and the players? That may be a bit of information overload, so I wanted to check before I started to compile the PMs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-17-2017, 12:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-18T13:05:24-07:00","id":1064444,"title":"","content":"Another option would be you just read the letters and make you own plot based on what has happened thus far.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe"