rs/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1211_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-08T12:04:28-07:00","id":1075201,"title":"","content":"New OOC thread here.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1075200-ooc-2-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-%E2%80%93-an-epistolary-game\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1075200-ooc-2-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-%E2%80%93-an-epistolary-game\"> [OOC-2] [Exalted 2.5] The Scarlet Sky Conspiracy &ndash; An Epistolary Game - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1075200-ooc-2-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-%E2%80%93-an-epistolary-game\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1075200-ooc-2-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-%E2%80%93-an-epistolary-game </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> In Character Thread (http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/998289-ic-exalted-2-5-the-scarlet-sky-conspiracy-%E2%80%93-an-epistolary-game) | Character Creation Thread (http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/993606-interest-check-realm-civil-war-play-by-post-epistolary-game-ex2) Restart! Welcome to OOC2. Four Experience points will be given per letter. I trust you to not phone this shit in. Posting Schedule I mean whenever really. I'll try be prompt! Characters Mnemon Aisa - BlueWinds (http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> For my sanity I'm gonna say you're all on 20xp. You got free access to edit your own sheets via the 1st post link, put in anything missing and feel free to spend XP as you like. I trust you all! Anything you need to clarify on yell at me now.<br /> <br /> Will probably be a post tomorrow as I got shit to do today!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1211-fansibubbles","name":"Fansibubbles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1211_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-08T16:27:59-07:00","id":1075293,"title":"","content":"Be warned Anathema charges exp for backgrounds and RAW dragon-blooded costs so my character sheet is technically 76 because of that. With Resplendent Wood I have 38 experience. I've been keeping record and can copy the ledger if necessary.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3103,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","user":"Eura","date":". 04-08-2017, 07:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}